(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Health has cooperated with the authorities to close Mr. Sou Seng Hour's traditional medicine shop after operating illegally and selling traditional medicine without permission from the Ministry.
The ministry said that despite promising to stop illegal activities, Su Seng Hour continued to post on Facebook about the treatment of abnormal diseases and the sale of traditional medicine without permission from the Ministry of Health.
"Observing these activities, the Health Department of the Phnom Penh Municipal Administration cooperated with the relevant authorities to stop illegal activities and instructed Mr. Sou Seng Hour to delete all the videos promoting the treatment of deceptive diseases from the social network Facebook. "Immediately." This is a confirmation of the Ministry of Health's measures on Mr. Xu Seng Hour's activities.
In this statement, the Ministry of Health called on people to be careful in deciding to receive illegal magic or traditional medicine and not to believe those false propaganda on social media, video clips or other advertisements that lead to Loss of money, time, health and may endanger life.
