3: Cultivation of corn in Kampot province to supply and produce animal feed in 2014.
4: Attracting a Japanese company headquartered in Malaysia on the supply of super sulphate seeds for animal feed production in 2015.
5: Establishment of a free kindergarten for children in Toul Kork district, Phnom Penh from 2014.
