Farmers rush to harvest rice at risk of flooding as traders buy cheaper at Prek Khum Chamnom canal
(Banteay Meanchey): When farmers rush to harvest rice, they are afraid of flooding, so traders buy cheap things at Prek canal in Khum Chamnom village, Mongkul Borei district.
On September 24, 2023, farmers reported that for almost a week, with continuous rain, the Bavel construction and the high forest construction in Bavel district, Battambang province, flooded after the rice fields west of the canal. Faced with flooding, farmers rushed to harvest both wet and unripe rice to collect from the flood.
Farmers confirmed that after farmers rushed to harvest rice for two to three days, suddenly traders bought rice at a discount by word of mouth, like fragrant rice, buy 1 ton for 10,500 baht, compared to before the flood. One ton of incense costs 1,150 baht, compared to last year, this year's price is more expensive than last year.
Farmers request the Banteay Meanchey Provincial Department of Commerce, Mr. Pok Lai Chi and Banteay Meanchey Provincial Governor, Mr. Oum Rath, and the Ministry of Agriculture to inspect and strengthen the rice market so that traders do not give verbal prices and lower prices, such as poor rice harvest. And wet rice by mouth that degrades the discount.
Chao Mey, chief of Chamnom commune, confirmed that when farmers rushed to harvest rice when the floods hit the rice fields, traders suddenly bought cheaper, but the price of rice in 2023 is more expensive than in 2022.
He said that the farmers who grow rice this year suffered from drought, which caused the rice to have more weeds, get less than last year, get 4 to 5 tons per hectare per day, traders buy fragrant rice and 54 rice and 51. Weeds of not less than 500 tons of rice that traders buy from Prek Khum Chamnom canal.
Today marks the 30th anniversary of the promulgation of the Constitution after the crisis
(Phnom Penh): Sunday, September 24, 2023 is the 30th anniversary of the promulgation of the Constitution of the Kingdom of Cambodia during the Second Kingdom. On October 6, 2023, the Constitutional Council will celebrate the 30th anniversary of the establishment of the Constitution of the Second Kingdom, which took place under the highest presidency of the King of Cambodia, His Majesty the King. His Majesty Norodom Sihamoni.
After the Paris Peace Agreement of October 23, 1991, which was the result of negotiations between two Cambodian political figures, Samdech Norodom Sihanouk (His Majesty the King) and Samdech Hun Sen (then Comrade Hun Sen), Cambodia recognized the election. In the first multi-party liberal democracy after more than three decades of civil war.
Stong District Governor Instructs Commune Administration to Pay More Attention to Poor and Flood Victims
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Say Kim Lam, Governor of Stong District, advised the commune administration to pay more attention to the lives of people who are poor and affected by floods.
He said this while visiting and distributing gifts to 18 families living in poverty and flood victims in Sophy village, Preah Damrey commune, Stong district, Kampong Thom province on the morning of September 24, 2023.
He instructed the village and commune authorities as well as stakeholders to maintain and repair various infrastructures, especially all roads that were affected by floods in a timely manner to restore quality and facilitate construction. Traffic of local people.
He expressed his deep gratitude to the philanthropists near and far who have always cooperated to provide food and other necessities to the Stong District Administration in carrying out humanitarian work as well as rescuing the people affected by the floods. This is the same as in the past.
Letter to readers: 30th anniversary of the day of the proclamation of the Constitution! Cambodia defends peace, territorial integrity, national sovereignty and respect for human rights, democracy
Cambodia has gone through a sad and tumultuous history of civil war, its people have lived in poverty for decades, but Cambodia began to rebuild its international reputation after the formation of its first government and continued to build and lead the country. Towards a development.
In the last 20 years or so, after Cambodia achieved full peace in December 1998 under the implementation of a win-win policy set by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister dissolved the Khmer Rouge political and military organization. Consideration of nation building and development.
But the corrupt tactics of the extremists and their foreign bosses could not succeed because of the power of the Great Umbrella and the sacred objects on the guardian angels of the Kingdom of Cambodia to help the Cambodian government and people know the tricks. This will prevent in time.
In total, for the past 30 years, Cambodia has consistently implemented its constitution and has well defended it. The observance of the Constitution for the past 30 years has indeed brought peace to the Kingdom of Cambodia, development and realization of Cambodia, and protection of territorial integrity and national sovereignty, as well as human rights and doctrines. Democracy is growing healthy.
