In fact, the cooperation between the two countries is really mutually beneficial. The United States will benefit from a strategic location and a young, low-wage workforce with the right skills for the manufacturing sector. This has resulted in lower prices for Cambodian-made goods for consumers in the United States, as Cambodia has benefited from exports to the US market.
As a country that has fully vaccinated its citizens and launched quickly, despite the turmoil in the global economy, Cambodia has strived to achieve 5.6 percent economic growth by 2023.
The Royal Government will accelerate the reform of key institutions and put in place measures to address the structural challenges that Cambodia has faced in the past, especially the business and investment climate, which is considered to be a major impact. Negative to Cambodia's competition in international markets.
I would like to emphasize that this law also incorporates the concept that allows us to be flexible to meet the needs of industry or investors, and we can be more flexible and competitive and more realistic in attracting and meeting the needs of investors.
In addition to the introduction of key reform measures, the Royal Government of Cambodia will continue to engage in dialogue with the private sector through regular intergovernmental forums between the government and the private sector. I will be the direct speaker to listen to the challenges and concerns as well as suggestions from local and international business and investors, as well as provide effective solutions and response measures.
The world economy is increasingly interconnected and interdependent. The state of one country's economy is rapidly affected by the state of the economy of other countries through this cell interface. In particular, on trade and investment activities, this proves that the regular promotion of cooperation between countries and countries in the form of trade and investment or cooperation is mutually beneficial. Come a lot.
