I hope investors will see investment opportunities and learn more about the economic potential and investment opportunities in Cambodia. We have the slogan "See once is better than hear a thousand times", so let investors come and find out about Cambodia.
The Royal Government will provide strong support for opportunities for operational and business expansion, as well as address all challenges, both old and new, in order to fully accelerate the development of the private sector and become a key partner of the Royal Government in promoting Elevate development for the mutual benefit and common prosperity of the environment. You all know this from my background in economics.
We hope the private sector will become our more important partner and we will launch new mechanisms in the future. We hope that we will become active actors and partners together, as the saying goes, "Together, think together, act responsibly, this is our vision for the future, and we want to see the private sector become more active." More.
