(Phnom Penh): New Hope in Cambodia and AITC from Australia have helped build a house for the family of Chhim Sovannara and his wife Lang Sokchen, who have moved from Angkor Park to the New Urban Development Zone. Run Ta Ek, Banteay Srey District, Siem Reap Province.
