Articles and pictures by Cambodia-China Friendship Radio in 30 days, Samdech Hun Sen Presides Over Outstanding National and International Work
(Phnom Penh): As of September 22, 2023, it has been only 30 days or one month that His Majesty the King Hun Manet was elected by the National Assembly to be the Prime Minister to lead the Royal Government of the 7th legislature of the National Assembly.
August 22, 2023 is a new day in the history of Cambodia, a time when Cambodia has changed its prime minister for nearly four decades. The change of top positions in the executive branch in each country is the most interesting thing, but for Cambodia it is even more interesting because it is a change in almost 40 years.
Let's take a look at the preparation of the successor, take a look at our state leadership of the successor. What have been the results for the nation during this month, Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet and Samdech's Council of Ministers?
Within a month, if we talk about the results, it seems too fast. However, we also see some significant work activities for the new government. The new Royal Government has set out its priority policies to improve the lives of the people, solve the problems of the people and take 2023 as its starting point to achieve the goal of high middle income countries by 2030 and A high-income country by 2050.
Based on the spirit of this policy, it was observed that immediately after the opening of the first cabinet meeting on August 24, 2023, the members of the Royal Government, who are ministers in various ministries, did not delay and went to work. Simultaneous activities.
His Excellency Hun Manet, as the head of the Royal Government, announced his strong commitment not to disappoint the people who decided to vote for the CPP. In the spirit of upholding the interests of the people as a whole, Samdech Dhipati paid high attention to all matters, which must be for the benefit of the people, for the benefit of the people and the nation, not to be done.
Samdech President Hun Manet also linked his life to people's issues through social media. Samdech President announced the establishment of a working group to monitor the problems of people posted on social media.
The story of the post chief also spread to the Deputy Commissioner of Kampot province, who is a former iPad thief, was also removed from the same position after the people's protests on social media.
Resolving the people's problems that started from the protests on social media has led to strong support from the people.
Through these six guest meetings, the relationship and cooperation between Cambodia and the countries involved in their respective fields will be further expanded.
For the second time, President Hun Manet led a delegation to pay an official visit to China and attend the 20th China-ASEAN Expo in Nanning, Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region from September 14 to 17.
The third is an invitation to address the United Nations General Assembly in New York, USA, from September 21 to 25.
During his overseas missions as well as his visit to China, President Hun Manet stated that all meetings with foreign friends are for the benefit of the nation and the people. Samdech President assured that in foreign relations, Samdech did not allow Cambodia to lose its national sovereignty.
The presence of Hun Manet at the United Nations is a clear message that the United Nations has recognized the Cambodian Prime Minister, and that the cries of some Cambodian opposition activists abroad have no effect or influence. . It's a coincidence that the day he delivered his message at the United Nations was the day he received the support of the National Assembly to become prime minister.
Hun Manet's Overseas Mission is not only for the benefit of the nation and the people of Cambodia. But as the leader of one of the ASEAN member states and the United Nations, Samdech also offered some ideas to contribute to solving the world's problems facing the economic crisis and the crisis of political rivalry as well as the war in Ukraine as well.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen, as a former leader of the country, praised the strength of Samdech Mani on the leadership of the state.
It is not under the pretext of Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet that Samdech Techo assessed that the leadership of Samdech Thipadei was good. Samdech Techo highlighted that Samdech had assessed that it would take at least three months for Samdech Thipadei to lead a stable country. But not so, in just one month, Samdech Hun Sen has shown his leadership well.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen once said, "Having practiced directly as Prime Minister for more than 38 years, I can say that Prime Minister Hun Manet did better than I thought. "Not to praise my own children. Before, I thought it would take about three months for the new prime minister to take full control of the work."
Samdech Techo added, "Contrary to my thinking, the Prime Minister left with confidence to control the situation in all areas, small and large in the country and to achieve foreign affairs. The goddess child will definitely not become a frog. ”
With knowledge from prestigious schools in the United States and the United Kingdom, practical experience, intelligence, and a high level of conscience, it is highly hoped that Hun Manet will succeed in leading the mission to lead Cambodia to maintain peace. Continue to develop, enhance national prestige, and make people more prosperous and prosperous. Court handles 10 gamblers in Kampong Cham after crackdown
