Dr. Oknha Bandith also pointed out that the country is peaceful, has developed and progressed to this day, thanks to Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen, who is an intelligent, intelligent and mature political leader. Progress on the development of roads, bridges, skyscrapers, growing like mushrooms, people have a comfortable life under the shadow of peace.
In this meeting, all the people were very happy to have Samdech Moha Bovathi Hun Sen as the Prime Minister to lead Cambodia to strengthen peace, the country is more developed, prosperous and proud, and the people are more Have a prosperous life and live in peace.
Finally, all the people are very excited, I would like to thank Duke Dr. Ly Samet, Personal Adviser and High Representative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, who always pays attention to the high guidance of Samdech Techo. Come down to check and visit people everywhere.
