(Kampong Thom): Mr. Nguon Rattanak, Governor of Kampong Thom Province, on September 21, 2023, led a professional officer to monitor the flood situation in Trea commune, Rong Roeung commune and Banteay Stong commune, Stong district.
On that occasion, Mr. Nguon Rattanak instructed the district authorities, commune chiefs of all communes to monitor and report immediately and regularly on the current flood situation in the local area regularly and in a timely manner.
The provincial governor urged district authorities to monitor the water level, collect data on the backs of flooded houses and report to higher levels to prepare aid and gifts for the affected families.
In addition, Mr. Nguon Rattanak urged all people to be very careful of the flood at this time, especially to take good care of children to avoid drowning, as well as protection from animals. Asirpis bite or sting and urge the district authorities to continue to monitor the flood situation to facilitate the preparation to help people in time.
