At the same time, the senior traffic official said that the tightening of the road traffic law is stronger than before, such as those who have not yet awakened to respect the traffic law, that is, those who Failure to follow the instructions and education of the authorities by imposing fines in accordance with the law.
Brigadier General Thi Visal said that the main purpose of restricting the education of the people, especially this restriction under the guidance of General Sar Thet, is to awaken the people to respect the law on road traffic without I want no one to run out of money to pay the fine, I want everyone to respect the law, and traffic officials do not want to see the loss of good human resources due to this traffic accident.
Brigadier General Thi Visal confirmed that according to this instruction, the road traffic police will start educating the people as well as tighten the law on road traffic even more, starting from the third week of September 2023. He also called on people to respect the road traffic law, starting with each of us to prevent and reduce road traffic accidents.
Please note that the General Commissioner of the National Police will use two measures to educate and tighten traffic laws throughout the country, the first: education and the second: to fine those who do not obey the law. The two measures will be implemented by road traffic police nationwide in all capitals and provinces. Chinese Vice President Han Zheng attended a high-level meeting on the achievements of the Global Development Initiative Cooperation Cooperation.
