"Beginning the 20-hour flight with a pile of documents to attend the 78th United Nations General Assembly in New York, USA," he wrote.
Samdech President Hun Manet has been trusted by the people and the National Assembly to hold the position of Prime Minister of the 7th term of the Royal Government for about a month. In the top position as the driver of the destiny of the nation and the people throughout the kingdom for about a month, the work schedule of Samdech Manet Hun Manet to carry. Through this work schedule, it is shown that he is busy in leading, managing and managing national affairs.
