The closing ceremony of the joint military exercise was presided over by General Tea Seiha, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of National Defense and representatives of the Chinese People's Liberation Army, and was attended by many Cambodian-Chinese officers, deputies and soldiers.
The Peace Angel Exercise 2023 was organized under the theme "Joint International Health, Humanitarian Rescue Operation in the Disaster, Flood and Flood Areas of the Cambodian and Chinese Armed Forces" on September 16, 2023.
The Chinese side has a total of 126 personnel, including 20 exercise leaders, 10 pilots, and 95 medical personnel. The Cambodian side has a total of 595 people, including 24 exercise leaders, 237 training forces, 334 service personnel.
Tevta Santepheap Exercise - 2023 organized the content of the exercise as a real military force, moving to locations related to the actual situation on seven topics, including: 1: Joint health forces, 2: Transportation Troops: 3rd: Deployment of operations, 4th: Rescue at the site, 5th: Transfer of victims for further treatment, 6th: Transfer of victims by air, and 7th: Prevent and prevent infectious diseases.
The exercise also celebrates the 65th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic ties between Cambodia and China, to enhance capacity, exchange experiences in health cooperation, effective disaster relief and communicable disease operations. And so on.
