As an expression of pride and nationalism that the Koh Ker resort has become a World Heritage Site, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Mani Hun Sen, has instructed to organize celebrations at ministries, institutions of the national, sub-national and armed forces. Weapons, educational institutions and monasteries together beat drums, drums, slaps and percussion.
