Mr. Sok Leng Meng, Director of Tbong Khmum Provincial Department of Water Resources and Meteorology, stated that in that activity, he inspected the condition of 3 riverbanks, including: river bank in Tuol Kor village, Tonle Bit commune, Tbong Khmum district, second location in Rokar Thom village, Chiro 1 commune. Tbong Khmum district and third, inspect the river bank in village 7, Roka Khnor commune, Krouch Chhmar district.
According to the conclusion of the Director of the Department of Water Resources, after visiting the actual location, it was found that the river water flowed into dams, lakes, canals and most of the farmland was submerged, as of today, can be assessed as a total of 75% separately. The three banks of the river have not changed significantly yet.
