Samdech President Hun Manet: Please trust the Royal Government of Cambodia led by me not to lose the interests of the people and national sovereignty (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Prime Minister Hun Manet called on the people to trust that the Royal Government of Cambodia Led by Samdech does not harm the interests of the people and national sovereignty.
