"I would like to send a message to people all over the country Is Cambodia trading with China as a Chinese nephew? Does trading with China make Cambodia lose its independence? "It's not, and I have confirmed my trust, my great-grandchildren, great-great-grandchildren, great-great-grandchildren, my brothers and sisters, Cambodia, the stronger Cambodia, its sovereignty must be maintained to make Cambodia richer." This is the confirmation of Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet.
