Samdech Mani President Hun Manet made this statement on the occasion of Samdech continuing to visit nearly 20,000 workers in Takeo province on the morning of September 19, 2023.
The president's remarks came in response to a radio broadcast criticizing and attacking his recent visit to China.
"Seeing a radio broadcast that some countries condemn Cambodia that Cambodia adheres to the one-China policy is bad," he said. I would like to ask you to re-research the 193 member countries of the United Nations, of which 181 countries have a Chinese position, including the United States. There is nothing wrong with Cambodia taking the same Chinese position. "All ASEAN also has the same Chinese position."
He said that Cambodia's politics is based on sustainability and consistency, based on basic policies, independent presidency, based on the law, creative, intelligent and based on the national interest.
He added that through its diplomatic policy with China, Cambodia also benefits from trade. He stressed that trade with China is not a bad thing, if trade with China is bad, it is not the United States, Europe and ASEAN member states to establish relations with China.
Please be informed that according to data from the General Department of Customs and Excise in the first eight months of 2023, the trade volume between Cambodia and China is worth more than 8 billion US dollars, an increase of 1.1% compared to the same period in 2022. .
