1. The Buddha is the founder of Buddhism. 2. Everyone can attain the same Noble Truth without regard to caste or ethnicity. Better people 4. Monastic community is an institution with a strong structure for Buddhism 5 - Equal rights and freedoms regardless of race, caste 6 - Buddhism teaches people to believe in the law of karma
