For September 18, 2023, this is the second day of the second youth forum. According to Ms. Duong Tep Sokunthea, Representative of the Cambodian Red Cross Youth Delegation, on the second day of the Second Youth Forum, the 11 National Youth Delegates of the National Association had the opportunity to discuss the implementation of the Youth Forum Statement. The first was built in Brunei in 2022.
