She said that today's discussion will be presented tomorrow to study in more depth, identify only one of the five topics to further discuss new solutions in the field of humanitarian and to build a statement. A new joint venture for the second Youth Forum 2023 and to present to the 11 leaders of the National Association on the first day of the leadership meeting held on September 21, 2023.
