(Phnom Penh): Pursuant to the direct orders of Major General Chuon Narin, Deputy Commissioner of National Police and Phnom Penh Municipal Police Commissioner, on the morning of September 18, 2023, Colonel Ouk Bonin, Meanchey District Police Inspector, co-led the operation. Khan Mean Unity Command conducted administrative work at irregular structures in Prek Ta Kong village, Chak Angre Leu commune, Meanchey district.
