Case 1: Steung Meanchey 3 Administrative Police patrolled the area to Veng Sreng Street, Damnak Thom 3 Village, Sangkat Steung Meanchey 3, Khan Meanchey and found 3 suspects riding a motorcycle with suspicion. Called for inspection, found a small package of white gram, and arrested the three suspects for questioning at the Stung Meanchey 3 Administrative Police Station.
Case 3: Steung Meanchey 2 Administrative Police patrolled the area to the point of Russey Village Road, Sangkat Steung Meanchey 2, Khan Meanchey, found a suspect walking with suspicion, called to check found Three transparent white bags were hidden in the left hand of Mey Moeun Sok Meng and the suspect was detained for questioning at Stung Meanchey 2 Administrative Police Station.
