In the past, the Chinese People's Liberation Army (PLA) has provided spiritual support, materials, medicine, vaccines, Kovid 19 and the construction of shelters for the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF), as well as military training for the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF).
