The news of the new Thai Prime Minister's visit to Cambodia was revealed during a meeting between Dr. Soeung Rathchawi, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, and Mr. Saran Charoen Sovann, Permanent Secretary of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Thailand. This is according to the press release of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Cambodia.
At the invitation of Mr. Saran Charoeun Sovann, Permanent Secretary of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Thailand, Dr. Soeung Rathchawi, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, led a delegation on a working visit to Bangkok on September 14-15, 2023.
