(Kampong Chhnang): Mr. Eang Sophalleth, Minister of Environment, urged the community to increase the cultivation of agricultural products as part of their daily livelihood and daily income, relying only on non-timber forest products. Face can not improve people's lives, should add more tourism services, so that people have more income.
Minister Eang Sophalleth made this call during a visit to the achievements and development plans of the Sre Ampil Protected Area Community in Kdol Village, Kdol Sen Chey Commune, Teuk Phos District, Kampong Chhnang Province on the morning of September 16, 2023.
