"Reliance on non-timber forest products alone can not improve people's livelihoods, should increase tourism services, so that people have more income," he said.
The opening ceremony of the 20th China-ASEAN Expo on "Building a Harmonious Community and One Destiny" was held on September 17, 2023 in Nanning, Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region, China.
President Hun Manet said that in the context of global uncertainty, the 20th China-ASEAN Expo is important for closer and harmonious regional ties to contribute to the promotion of Sustainable development.
"This also shows that cooperation combined with free and open trade is the only way to truly bring about overall peace and prosperity," he said. "
He said that when the Kovid-19 disease caused a global upheaval, all human movements were slowed down, but the flow of trade continued. In 2021 and 2022, trade in goods increased above the previous level of Kovid-19 outbreak, which underscores the important role of trade in ensuring the socio-economic security of the world's people.
As the epidemic crisis subsides, we are facing other challenges, such as rising commodity prices, strategic food security, and the effects of climate change. At this point, Samdech highlighted the important role of trade in addressing these global challenges to ensure that interdependence and globalization are mutually beneficial.
He stressed that trade should not be used as a weapon that undermines global economic security.
