Samdech Hun Sen emphasized that the Royal Government of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Hun Sen himself will continue to maintain the same position, especially to continue to implement a consistent Chinese policy. The Prime Minister added that Cambodia continues to support China in the regional and global framework, as well as continue to support China's initiatives.
