(Phnom Penh): The assailant who killed a fortune teller on July 22, 2023 in Srah Chak commune, Daun Penh district, Phnom Penh, was arrested by the specialized police force on September 15, 2023. In Peal Nhek 2 Village, Sangkat Phteah Prey, Pursat City, Pursat Province.
A report from the Phnom Penh Municipal Police, obtained by Fresh News, states that the arrest was carried out in accordance with an arrest warrant issued by the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, detaining Nuon Kheng, a 51-year-old female resident of Chrey Tnaot village, commune. Nheng Nheng, Tram Kak district, Takeo province.
This operation was carried out under the guidance of Major General Chuon Narin, Deputy Commissioner and Commissioner of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police, Khan Post Joint Force and Heavy Office of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police Commissioner and Daun Penh District Police Inspector in cooperation with Pursat Provincial Police.
Currently, after the arrest, the police brought the suspect to the Phnom Penh Municipal Police for legal action.
