The official welcoming ceremony of the historic visit of His Excellency Hun Manet was held at the Great Hall of the People in Beijing, China. The Prime Minister of the People's Republic of China, Li Chheang, came out to welcome and welcome the visit of Samdech Manet with high-level protocol.
A long red carpet and many dignitaries are preparing to receive the official visit of Samdech Manet.
