This instruction was made on the morning of September 15, 2023 in the meeting of the Phnom Penh Municipal Administrative Unity Command, which was attended by the Deputy Governor of Phnom Penh, the Phnom Penh Municipal Police, the Commander of the Phnom Penh Municipal Gendarmerie and the 14 District Governors. .
Mr. Khuong Sreng reminded that at the first meeting of the Council of Ministers on August 24, 2023, Prime Minister Hun Manet launched the "Pentagon Strategy" as a political program for building and defending the motherland 2023. -2028.
He said the Pentagon strategy focuses on human capital development, economic diversification and competitiveness, private sector and employment development, resilient development, sustainability and environmental and economic development. And digital society.
Mr. Khuong Sreng stated that "The opening of the Phnom Penh Municipal Administrative Unity Command is now to encourage all competent forces, 14 Khan authorities and departments under the Phnom Penh Municipal Administration to implement the first phase of the Pentagon strategy of the Royal Government." Seventh, under the leadership of Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet was successful.
He added that the Pentagon strategy takes into account the well-being of the people, the promotion of vocational training for the poor who do not have access to education, social assistance without leaving people to starve. Implement measures to ensure the safety of villages and communes, efforts to resolve disputes out of court and illegal construction.
Mr. Khuong Sreng urged the competent forces and the 14 Unity Commands to sharpen their will to crack down on gambling and drugs in their localities, as well as to prepare for traffic congestion and prepare for Upcoming major national festivals.
