During his first official visit to China as the Prime Minister of Cambodia, on Friday, September 15, 2023, His Excellency Hun Manet began to meet with China's top leaders.
Welcoming the presence of President Hun Manet, President Xi Jinping stressed that Cambodia-China friendship is like a huge tree with deep and strong roots, and the two nations bear fruit. Invaluable forever.
He reiterated that China remains a good friend and will continue to assist Cambodia on the path of economic development. The current official visit of the President will bring more success to the achievement of building a common destiny community in the new era between Cambodia and China.
In this important meeting and reaffirming the strong political position between the new leaders of Cambodia on the relationship between Cambodia and China, the Chinese President affirmed that China will continue to support and cooperate with Cambodia in all fields without change. No. The Chinese president also vowed to protect justice for both Cambodia and China from negative attempts.
Separately, the new leader of Cambodia, Samdech Hun Sen, reaffirmed his political position to the Chinese President that Cambodia continues to adhere to the one-China policy.
Hun Manet further highlighted the long-standing Cambodia-China relations that the two nations are bearing fruit in all fields, especially economy and education. The Prime Minister stressed that the development and progress of Cambodia today can not be separated from the support and cooperation of the Chinese friends. In fact, China's support in the difficult circumstances of the fight against Kovid-19.
During the meeting, President Hun Manet highlighted to the Chinese President the direction and areas of cooperation for the future between the two countries, such as energy, food security, and investment. In fact, the President requested the Chinese side to continue to support Cambodia's guarantee of energy security and food security, and thanked for the import of rice and other agricultural products from Cambodia.
President Hun Manet also thanked China for its past efforts to encourage and encourage Chinese investors to invest in Cambodia. Especially in key priority areas that benefit the Cambodian people.
