GC Orussey issued a press release rejecting some baseless misinformation that harmed the company's reputation
(Phnom Penh): GC Orussey Co., Ltd. of GC Orussey Market Project on September 15 issued a statement and issued a press release rejecting some unfounded misinformation that harmed the company's reputation.
GC Orussey, the sole distributor of the GC Orussey Market project, has stated that it rejects the publication of a number of unsubstantiated allegations that undermine the reputation and trust of its customers. This company can not accept.
In order to present the Company's position in participating in the development and investment in the real estate sector in the Kingdom of Cambodia in accordance with the policy of the Royal Government of Cambodia, the Company would like to confirm the following:
1: The company's GC Orussey Market project is a project that is clear and thoroughly studied to meet the needs of all customers and the public who are interested in the company's project and now the company has been hitting the foundation for construction. In accordance with the company's plan to customers without delay.
2. GC Orussey Co., Ltd. remains committed to the implementation of the GC Orussey Market project and adheres to the contents of the contract made with all customers in the spirit of integrity and highest responsibility. In this sense, if the company can not complete the construction and can not deliver the market stall to the customer in time according to the contract, the company is willing to pay compensation to the customer as stated in the contract.
Based on the above position, the company urges all customers to understand and wait for positive results from the company, and the company also reserves its legal right to implement legal measures to protect the interests of customers and the company in case There is baseless misinformation or provocative content or intentionally a window of honor to the company's reputation.
