(Kratie): A wildlife trader in O'Kreang Sen Chey district, Kratie province, was detained by the Kratie Provincial Court on charges of transporting and trading meat, processing animal samples and importing wildlife without permission.
The suspect was named Chak Cham, an active wildlife trader in Sre Treng village, Kbal Damrey commune, O'Kreang Sen Chey district, Kratie province. The detention was made in accordance with the judgment of Mr. Kuy Pito, Investigating Judge of Kratie Provincial Court on September 13, 2023.
It should be noted that on September 11, 2023, a joint force led by Mr. Rabo Randy, Deputy Prosecutor of Kratie Provincial Court, inspected a restaurant in Sre Treng Village, Kbal Damrey Commune, O'Kreang Sen Chey District, Kratie Province. This restaurant sells a variety of wildlife on a regular basis.
In this operation, the police found many kinds of wild animals, including: 5 fighting animals weighing 7 kg, 40 kg wild boar, 10 kg wild buffalo meat.
The pagodas were set on fire by the authorities, while the active wildlife trader, Chak Chhem, was remanded in custody, while his wife, Sok Khoeun, was attacked and stoned. Escape.
