Therefore, land registration is to strengthen the security of land tenure, which will promote the potential use of land, and this factor will definitely reduce poverty, which is the ultimate goal of the Royal Government's policy to promote land registration.
The provincial governor further stated that the title deed received by the people today is a very important document, a document representing their property, a document representing the ownership, which is the exclusive right of the owner of his land to use and enjoy the sale. Transfer to another person, guaranteeing the loan, transferring the inheritance to the children in accordance with the law, so the owner should keep this title as best as possible.
