Lok Chumteav Pech Chanmony Visits the Great Wall of China with Admiration for this Amazing Historic Building (Video inside) (Beijing, China) Cambodia, Lok Chumteav Dr. Pech Chanmony Hun Manet, is scheduled to visit the Great Wall of China on Friday morning, September 15, 2023.
The presence of Lok Chumteav Bandit was warmly welcomed by the leaders of the Great Wall. During the visit, Lok Chumteav Dr. and all the accompanying delegation visited all parts of the Great Wall, the most famous and wonderful historical building in the world.
She told the leadership of the Great Wall that this was the first time she had visited the Great Wall, although she had read the history of the Great Wall before. Lok Chumteav Dr. said that she came to visit in person is really a great historical building.
She thanked the Chinese government for organizing this special event so that she could see firsthand the Great Wall, the precious history of the country and the people of China.
The Great Wall of China (ten thousand liters long wall) is a series of fortifications built across the northern border of ancient China and the Chinese emperor throughout history to prevent opposition and aggression by nomadic groups. From the outside area.
Today, the Fortress of the Great Wall is widely recognized as one of the most impressive architectural masterpieces in Chinese history. The Great Wall of China is visited by world leaders, millions of international tourists, especially domestic tourists each year.
It should be noted that on the occasion of visiting the Great Wall, Lok Chumteav Dr. Pech Chanmony Hun Manet wrote on the Golden Book to confirm the presence, time, day, month and year of the visit to the Great Wall to be kept in the library of the Great Wall. The wall. On that occasion, the leaders of the Great Wall presented a photo book of the Great Wall to Lok Chumteav Bandith and took a souvenir photo in the most friendly atmosphere.
