(Kampong Chhnang): A fishing boat of the people capsized in the river at 9:10 am on September 14, 2023 at the wooden bridge in Phsar Chhnang village, Sangkat Phsar Chhnang, Kampong Chhnang city. The incident happened when a woman opened her ballast from shopping at the lower market in Kampong Chhnang and overturned on her way home.
According to a report from Kampong Chhnang police, prior to the incident, a 37-year-old woman named Phorn Srey Mom, a resident of Kampong Os Krom village, Kampong Os commune, Chulkiri district, drove a ferry from the French dam to her home. She was carrying a bulky luggage and a four-year-old daughter with her.
When driving to the scene near the wooden bridge, the boat was stuck in gear and caused it to overturn. In the incident, a 4-year-old girl drowned in the river for more than an hour, but she died, but the family took the girl to the hospital. She was pronounced dead at the scene.
