New era of Cambodia-China friendship
The Cambodian-Chinese friendship, cherished by His Majesty the King and the older generation of Chinese leaders, has been carefully developed and maintained by the leaders of both generations and the people of both countries. Strive to maintain and value this precious and precious traditional friendship as well.
The leaders of the two countries often use the words "good neighbor, good friend, good partner, good brother" to compare the Cambodian-Chinese relationship, which clearly shows the diplomatic policy of holding each other as a priority. In particular, the solidarity between the two countries has become a model of friendly relations between large and small countries and reflects mutual respect, harmony and equality between different nations and civilizations.
In addition, just seven months after Samdech Techo's visit to China, on September 14, the new Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Mani Hun Sen, will pay an official visit to China. The decision to make China the first destination for his first visit as Prime Minister demonstrates the will of the President and the Cambodian government to strengthen and expand the steel ties between Cambodia and China.
Indeed, the meeting between the successor leaders of Cambodia and the top leaders of China during the visit of the President is the common expectation of the people of the two countries. We can be confident that this visit will be fruitful, benefit the people of the two countries and usher in a new era of bilateral ties, as well as lead the Cambodia-China Friendship Ship towards a brighter future. Of course.
