The first visit of Prime Minister Hun Manet to China is a viable choice in terms of geography and national interest (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): This morning, Thursday, September 14, 2023, The Cambodian Minister will lead a high-level delegation of the Royal Government of Cambodia to pay an official visit to China.
Regarding this visit, Mr. Pen Bona, the spokesman of the Royal Government, said that the first visit of Prime Minister Hun Manet to China is a suitable choice in terms of geography and national interest.
The spokesman of the Royal Government raised five points to explain as follows:
First, the Kingdom of Cambodia adheres to the policy of permanent neutrality and non-alignment. Cambodia coexists peacefully with its neighbors and all countries in the world. This is the content of Article 53 of the Constitution, which clarifies Cambodia's consistent foreign policy line. Is a colorful foreign policy that is best suited to the realities of Cambodia as well as to the global context.
Second, the visit of the Prime Minister of Cambodia to China from September 14 to 16, 2023 is the most appropriate choice in terms of geography and economic interests, because China is a neighbor in the region as a superpower. The second largest economy in the world and Cambodia's largest development partner.
Third, the visit of the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia to China confirms the good and close relations between the two countries and peoples. The core of this good relationship is based on the spirit of friendship, equality, mutual respect, mutual respect and non-interference in each other's internal affairs.
Fourth, the visit of President Hun Manet to China does not mean that Cambodia has abandoned other countries. The Royal Government of Cambodia is happy to welcome and welcome foreign friends everywhere, regardless of whether the country is small or large, rich or poor, that is, Cambodia values equal friendship with all foreigners in the world and also wishes to return Give the same value from foreign friends as a sovereign state.
Fifth, all the countries in the world now have relations with China and want to improve this relationship for their own economic benefit. Therefore, Cambodia, a small country in the vicinity of China, also needs to build good relations with China for the benefit of both countries and peoples. This is the smartest and most appropriate choice for Cambodia and does not harm the interests of any country.
