According to the Law of the Kingdom of Cambodia, Article 40: Illegal storage, transportation and trafficking of drugs: shall be punished by imprisonment from 2 to 5 years. In addition to imprisonment, the offender may be fined from 4 million Riels. To 10 million riels.
Article 45: Illegal Use of Drugs: Any person who illegally uses drugs in the first and second tables of the city in any form and has been subjected to compulsory medical treatment shall be punished by imprisonment for one month. Up to 6 months can be fined from 100,000 to 1 million riels. In case of non-recidivism, shall be punished from 6 months to 1 year and fined from 1 million to 2 million riels.
