Minister Neth Pheaktra: Cambodia is playing an important role in ASEAN and within the framework of economic and political cooperation in the international arena.
(Phnom Penh): Cambodia is playing an important role in the ASEAN region and within the framework of economic and political cooperation in the international arena and coincides with the planned visit of Cambodian Prime Minister Hun Manet to China. On September 14 tomorrow.
This was emphasized by Mr. Neth Pheaktra, Minister of Information in the opening ceremony of the "Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement: Political Geography and Economic Geography", introduced by Prof. Dr. Sok Siphana, Senior Minister in charge of Special Mission On September 13, 2023, the office of the Ministry of Information.
The Minister of Information stated that the Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement (RCEP) is very important for Cambodia, which the general public, especially traders and investors, both national and international, need to understand. About strategies to take advantage of this agreement. Therefore, journalists have a very important role to play in bringing all this information to the public.
He said the concept of the agreement was initiated during the 19th ASEAN Summit in November 2011 and was discussed a year later at the 21st ASEAN Summit. November 2012 in Phnom Penh.
Please be reminded that this huge free trade agreement came into force on January 1, 2022 at the same time. This means that when Cambodia started its third ASEAN chairmanship, this agreement was established in our country, and ten years later this agreement came into force on the territory of our Kingdom of Cambodia again. More.
The Minister of Information strongly believes in the media to help spread the word about the RCEP to the general public, especially foreign investors and business people who wish to do business in Cambodia so that Cambodia can benefit. Full of this agreement.
