(Kampong Chhnang): A widow with three young children living in poverty, whose husband died in a car accident, thanked the police and the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Court for taking care to prepare documents to remove a motorcycle. Her husband's car, which was involved in a traffic accident, was kept at the Boribo District Police Inspectorate for one year.
The widow, Chea Sokchea, 36, has three young sons and currently lives in Phsar village, Phsar commune, Baribo district, Kampong Chhnang province. Due to her lack of livelihood and her husband's death, she left behind three young children in her care, with no livelihood and no means to support her three young children and her elderly mother with God. More than 80 years in another charge.
On the morning of September 11, 2023, she came to the President of Kampong Chhnang Provincial Court directly to ask for the motorcycle of her husband, who was riding in a traffic accident and was taken to the district police inspectorate. Abundant for the past year to be used as a way to travel, raise children.
He and his family will always remember these great merits, especially the efforts of the court team who worked hard to help him get rid of the motorcycle as a means. Especially for his family, who are struggling to make ends meet and need a way to support their children and mothers who are elderly and blind.
She also thanked Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police Commissioner, Provincial Road Traffic Police Chief and Boribo District Police Inspector for facilitating the documents and returning the motorcycle to her family for use as a means of transportation.
Please be reminded that the husband of the widow of the above three children, Heng Kongkea, 36 years old, met with a traffic accident and died at 8:25 pm on September 25, 2022 on National Road No. 5 by a person. The victim was riding a motorcycle and hit the back of a car of a military police officer, which was left on the national road at night at Thmey village, Phsar commune, Baribo district, Kampong Chhnang province, and died immediately at the scene. This too.
