In particular, the Kathina Festival is a precious festival in Buddhism, which is held once a year and lasts for 29 days, with a pagoda receiving a Kathina Festival as a gift for grandparents and devotees. This year, the Kathina Festival will take place from the 1st of Roach, the month of Assoch, to the 15th day of the month of Keat, which is from October 30 to November 27, 2023.
