National Audit Authority organizes a workshop to disseminate the "Audit Law and Public Audit Standards of the Kingdom of Cambodia" in Battambang Province
(Battambang): The National Audit Authority organized a workshop to disseminate the "Audit Law and Public Audit Standards of the Kingdom of Cambodia" in Battambang Province on the morning of September 12, 2023, chaired by Dr. Suon Sethy, Deputy Auditor General and Dr. Som Kim. Sour, Auditor General of the National Audit Authority and with the participation of Mr. Asarum, Provincial Councilor and Mr. Pheng Sethy, Deputy Governor, Mr. Sok Loo, Deputy Governor of Battambang.
The event was also attended by leaders and officials from specialized departments and relevant units, as well as the Armed Forces and leaders of municipal / district and commune / sangkat of Battambang Provincial Administration, a total of about 200 people.
Mr. Pheng Sethy warmly welcomed and noted that for the Battambang Provincial Administration, the organization of this workshop was a great opportunity to learn about the "Audit Law and Public Audit Standards of God." The Kingdom of Cambodia.
Dr. Prohm Vichet Sophorn, Deputy Secretary General and Lecturer of the National Audit Authority, gave a presentation on "Audit Law and Public Audit Standards of the Kingdom of Cambodia", focusing on four key points:
* First, the background of the National Audit Authority * Second, why there is a law on the audit of the Kingdom of Cambodia * Third - the content of the audit law of the Kingdom of Cambodia * Fourth - the standard of public audit of the Kingdom of Cambodia to officials Civil servants and the armed forces, as well as all municipal / district, sangkat / commune officials under the Battambang Provincial Administration.
Dr. continued that the National Audit Authority is an independent public institution on the operation and has the duty to monitor and recommend correction of any mistakes of the Audit Sub-Unit and send the audit report to the legislature, namely the National Assembly and the Senate. And copy to the Royal Government and the audit report is made public.
On that occasion, he also gave a presentation and explained the content in detail to the whole workshop to understand and open to ask questions and explain to the participants to understand clearly.
After presenting to the participants, in the afternoon of the same day, the dissemination workshop on "Law on Audit and Public Audit Standards of the Kingdom of Cambodia" at Battambang Provincial Administration was closed for one day. Successfully.
Dr. Suon Sethy thanked all the participants who came to attend the dissemination workshop "Law on Audit and Public Audit Standards of the Kingdom of Cambodia" in Battambang province.
