Mr. Sun Chanthol also claimed that in order to attract investors to Cambodia or to invest in economic zones, he was ready to fly abroad to meet, negotiate or explain directly to investors who want to invest in Cambodia.
During the visit to the special economic zone with the participation of relevant officials, Mr. Sun Chanthol called on all relevant officials of Cambodia to work together to facilitate the issuance of documents to encourage investors in Cambodia. .
Mr. Sun Chanthol emphasized that if the leaders try to attract investors to Cambodia and officials create obstacles for investors, the Royal Government's efforts will not be fruitful.
