(Preah Vihear): Choam Ksan District Authority and Preah Vihear Provincial Department of Public Works and Transport on the morning of September 11, 2023 inspected a dam on the sidewalk of National Road No. 62, km 204 + 300 in geography. Trapeang Sangke Khang Lech village, Kantuot commune, Choam Ksan district, to find measures to release water to facilitate the living and travel of the people.
