Through a press release issued on September 11, 2023, the Ministry of Justice is also continuing to develop the Digital Judgment Bulletin Service in the second phase to provide more speed and convenience to the public in order to reduce Spend time and money on the public in requesting the bulletin in accordance with the Pentagon Strategy - Phase 1 of the Royal Government of Cambodia, 7th legislature of the National Assembly.
For people abroad who need to apply for a Judgment Bulletin, the Ministry of Justice has been cooperating with the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation to discuss the procedures and procedures for requesting a Judgment Bulletin through Cambodian embassies in various countries. The Ministry of Justice will inform the procedures and procedures for requesting convictions for Cambodians abroad in the near future.
