(Banteay Meanchey): Poipet Municipal Gendarmerie Local Force led by Brigadier General Nuon Ninaro, Municipal Gendarmerie Local Commander, on September 7, 2023, arrested a Thai national in a case of intentional violence with aggravating circumstances and acts. Theft took place at 2:00 AM on September 5, 2023 at a rented room around Wat Trach in Kbal Spean 1 Village, Sangkat O'Chrov, Poipet City, Banteay Meanchey Province.
Later, the suspect entered the bathroom with a good opportunity, the victim ran out of the room naked and came out of the room in front of the stairs, the suspect ran to drag the victim back into the room, while the neighbors (A Thai national) arrived to help the victim, took the victim's clothes and took him to a Thai hospital for 2 days before returning and filing a complaint at the police station. Poi City Armed Forces.
