Samdech said: "As you ask, remember! Our leaders, Samdech Techo and our leaders, who have led the country for 44 years, not only liberated the people from the genocidal regime, maintained economic stability, reformed the interior, and went abroad to negotiate little by little. The merits and efforts of our leaders of all generations, especially Samdech Techo.
