National Police Force Arrests Suspect in Telephone Fraud Case
(Phnom Penh): The specialized force of the Department of Technology Crimes in cooperation with the Phnom Penh Municipal Police under the coordination of Mr. Seng Heang, Deputy Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court on September 7, 2023, arrested a suspect named Rem Kong Nou Dara, 43 years old, false business, who created the Telegram social media system using pictures and names of leaders.
The Anti-Technology Crime Department claimed that the suspect had set up a telegram account in the name of Lt. Gen. Mao Sophan, Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, and in the name of Senior Minister Kun Kim. Ek Mao Sophan and Senior Minister Kun Kim to deceive to send money under the image of collecting money to help the military family.
A few days later, on August 29, 2023, Senior Minister Kun Kim also announced to the authorities to search for the suspect who created the Telegram with a photo and the name "Kun Kim". The suspect has now been sent to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court for further legal action.
