(Battambang): Mr. Sok Lou, Governor of Battambang Province and Chairman of the Battambang Provincial Committee of the Cambodian Red Cross, on the afternoon of September 08, 2023, visited and brought humanitarian donations to the people affected by the drought. There are 162 poor families living in Sakor village, Talas commune, Maung Russey district, Battambang province.
In addition, he reported that climate change has caused some areas of Battambang province to suffer from natural disasters caused by floods, and some areas have suffered from drought, which has affected the livelihoods, livelihoods and crops of Citizens.
