It should be noted that at the invitation of Mr. Joko Widodo, President of Indonesia and Chairman of ASEAN, on September 4, 2023, His Excellency Hun Manet and Lok Chumteav led a high-level delegation of the Royal Government of Cambodia to attend the Summit. The 43rd ASEAN Summit and other relevant summits.
The ASEAN Summit and Related Summits are an important forum for Southeast Asian countries and dialogue partners to discuss issues. In particular, the search for opportunities in politics, economics and other social issues in line with the three pillars of ASEAN, including: the security-political community, the economic community and the socio-cultural community that are interrelated and influential.
The pre-year-long forum in the ASEAN region is short, but the number of meetings is high, so the leaders of ASEAN member countries and the leaders of ASEAN dialogue partners, especially leaders of ASEAN member states, are busy. When changing clothes is almost not yet.
In addition to being invited to attend the meeting, which is the agenda of ASEAN, Samdech Hun Sen, on the occasion of his first diplomatic mission as Cambodia's Prime Minister, also met with leaders of ASEAN member countries and leaders of partner countries. ASEAN Dialogue as well. This meeting is a courtesy call and seeks opportunities to expand cooperation and communication as Cambodia's new leader.
In the first diplomatic mission of His Excellency Hun Manet in the ASEAN forum, also led to high interest from national and international public opinion. Interestingly, Samdech Hun Manet is the leader of the new ASEAN member countries and making his first appearance at the ASEAN Forum and is also the youngest of ASEAN leaders and ASEAN dialogue partners.
One can also assess the momentum of the interest of the Cambodian people to the activities of the President through the video posted on the media. All the videos of the President and his wife from the time of departure to the meetings in Jakarta were viewed by many people and expressed their satisfaction, admiration and admiration for the President.
In that, Mr. Pen Bona, the Minister accompanying the Prime Minister, expressed his personal interest until he likened Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet to a star who shone in the ASEAN forum.
Mr. Pen Bona highlighted that the points that led to the President's attraction due to four factors, including:
First, Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet is the incarnation of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, a famous politician in Cambodia, as well as in the regional and international arena.
Second, a worthy personality, good looks, good manners and morals, as well as the youngest among other leaders, is a point that attracts everyone to look at the character of Samdech Hun Sen Manet.
Third, ability and self-confidence are strong challenges that enable the president to fulfill his diplomatic mission well beyond expectations, even for the first time.
Fourth, Cambodia's successive and young leaders also demonstrated outstanding diplomatic ability in high-level international negotiations to participate in regional and global peace, as well as to benefit the nation, the motherland and the people. People. Check out the gallery of important pictures on international events on September 7, 2023!
