The meeting took place on September 7, 2023 at the headquarters.
On that occasion, Minister Chheang Ra also thanked the Embassy and the people of Australia, who have always supported the Ministry of Health of Cambodia in building a strong and resilient health care system in Cambodia through financing under the framework of technical cooperation assistance. And grant financing to the health sector in the past, such as:
3: Life Saving Partner Program 2013-2018 for Improving Reproductive Health, Maternal and Child Health in 4 Northeastern Provinces of Cambodia and Selected Garment Factories in Phnom Penh
