(Oddar Meanchey): A man has been remanded in custody by the investigating judge of Oddar Meanchey Provincial Court after the suspect violently beat his wife, resulting in her death.
Roeun Ra, a 43-year-old man living in Ou Svay village, Ou Svay commune, Trapeang Prasat district, Oddar Meanchey province, was the husband of the suspect who beat his wife to death and was sent to prison. The victim's wife is Lach Sambath, alias Da, a 31-year-old female.
