The meeting took place on the afternoon of Thursday, September 7, 2023, with the participation of Mr. and Mrs. leaders and relevant officials at the Ministry of Public Works and Transport. Agriculture official: Although the price of rice has fallen slightly in recent days, it is still higher than last year
(Phnom Penh): Agriculture officials said that although in the last three to five days, the price of rice in some areas has fallen slightly, but this price is still good and higher than last year, which makes farmers still Make a profit.
According to agricultural officials, after the last three to five days, farmers in Battambang province have been upset about the fall in rice prices for no apparent reason.
Regarding this issue, Mr. Chhim Vachira, Chief of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries of Battambang Province, told Fresh News on September 7 that the price of rice in Battambang province has dropped slightly in the past 3 to 5 days due to Vietnamese traders. Rush to buy rice from farmers in some provinces such as Battambang, Pursat, Kampong Thom, Banteay Meanchey, Prey Veng, etc. have stopped buying.
He said that during August, Vietnamese traders rushed to buy, while local traders also bought for export, which increased the price of rice to more than 1.2 million to 1.3 million riel. Sen Riel per ton for weed and fragrant rice sold up to 1.4 million riel per ton.
However, he said that the case of poor quality rice in some places also caused the price of rice to fall.
He added that although the last three to five days, the price of rice has fallen slightly, but this price is still higher than last year.
He said farmers should not be too worried about falling rice prices, as rice prices in the international market are currently rising sharply, while stakeholders are working together to find a solution to the problem.
"What we are trying to solve is that from now on, we will work together to prevent rice from falling below the value of 1.1 million to 1.1 million riels for weeds and rice," he said. 1.2 million per tonne for fragrant rice.
Regarding this issue, Mr. Yang Saing Koma, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, said that the price of rice is still good for farmers today, especially compared to 2022 at the same time, the price is higher than 1,000 riel. One kilogram last year was between 800 and 900 riel per kilogram for OM varieties, although the last two or three days have seen a slight drop in prices in some areas.
