(Phnom Penh): Mr. Neth Pheaktra, Minister of Information, briefed Mr. UENO Atsushi, Ambassador of Japan to Cambodia on the modernization and efforts of the Ministry of Information on the development of public media to make the Ministry of Information Public relations institutions of the Royal Government of Cambodia to provide accurate information to the people, including national and international.
During the meeting held on the morning of September 6, 2023, Minister Net Pheakdra highlighted the Ministry of Information's reform in the joint efforts of the public media, including the Cambodian News Agency, AKP, National Radio and TVK in providing true information to the people of Cambodia through both its traditional and modern media.
Minister Neth Pheaktra said: "The priority work that you will be doing as Minister of Information is to focus on modernizing institutions and modern administration to make this Ministry of Information a public relations institution of the Royal Government. "Cambodia, which is proactive, active, quality and effective, aims to spread the truth of our Cambodia to the national and international community."
