Samdech Techo Hun Sen: The presence of Mr. Say Borey makes the Cambodian People's Party receive more rare human resources (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, welcomed with warmth and pleasure. For the presence of Dr. Say Borey in the Cambodian People's Party. Samdech Techo considered Say Borey's presence as a rare access to more human resources for the CPP.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed such welcome after Mr. Say Borey posted a message about his decision to re-enter politics with the Cambodian People's Party.
Samdech Techo emphasized, "Once again, on behalf of the Cambodian People's Party, I would like to warmly welcome His Excellency Say Borey, who has decided to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party." Through the participation of HE Say Borey, the CPP will receive more respected intellectuals and rare human resources. I would like to wish His Excellency Say Borey and his family happiness and prosperity. ”
It should be noted that about an hour ago, the well-known law professor, Dr. Say Borey, posted a message announcing his decision to re-enter the political arena after a break of nearly 30 years.
He said that he clearly understood the ideology of leading the country of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, which in depth is in line with his ideals, especially seeing clearly the continuous progress of national development, national prestige and people's peace. Cambodians under the umbrella of peace.
"I can clearly see that the situation in our country is good in almost all areas, and the foundation of peace, as well as the organization of a succession of leaders by the next generation, with His Majesty Hun Manet," he said. "A full-fledged intellectual will continue to make our country more prosperous and nationally prestigious on the international stage, and the people will continue to live in peace under the umbrella of peace."
According to Mr. Say Borey, on the morning of September 5, 2023, he sent a message of respect to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, to express his intention to join the Cambodian People's Party. Continue the nation-building process behind you, take the next step towards the progress of society faster.
According to Mr. Say Borey, Samdech Techo has decided to accept him to join the CPP. Mr. Say Borey thanked Samdech Techo Hun Sen for deciding to accept me immediately as a member of the Cambodian People's Party today.
