(Svay Rieng): A suspect was arrested in a case of intentional aggravated violence that caused a man to be seriously injured while drinking alcohol and having a verbal dispute with each other in a drinking party.
This incident happened at 9 am on September 5, 2023 at Samrong village, Krous commune, Svay Chrum district.
According to Svay Chrum district authorities, the suspect was named Mon Sao Linh, 30 years old, Khmer, unspecified occupation, residing in Samrong village, Krous commune, Svay Chrum district, Svay Rieng province. The victim was named Bouch Vorn, male, 40 years old, ethnic Khmer Occupation Farmer Residence: Samrong Village, Krous Commune, Svay Chrum District, Svay Rieng Province.
According to the villagers, before the incident, the victim and the suspect were seen sitting and drinking happily together until they were drunk. The victim was hit on the head and body with several sticks, causing serious injuries, causing the villagers to come and help.
Police said that after the suspect used violence, he was arrested and brought to Svay Chrum District Police Inspector to build a case for legal action, while the victim was taken by his family to Svay Chrum District Referral Hospital for treatment.
