The following is a Royal Decree: The Mine Authority receives assistance from the Government and Government of Japan for use in the operation of humanitarian mine action in Cambodia.
Mr. UENO Atsushi, Ambassador of Japan to Cambodia, praised the results of demining work in Cambodia, the largest area since the end of the war. Cambodia's achievement is also contributed by the Royal Government and the people of Japan, and Japan hopes that the remaining landmines and explosive remnants of war will be liberated from Cambodian territory and that the Cambodian people will be safe.
He added that in addition to assisting in demining work in Cambodia, Japan has also assisted Cambodia in international cooperation, most recently with the training of experts from Ukraine.
Kremlin says it could not confirm the summit between Putin and Kim Jong Un
MOSCOW (Reuters) - The Kremlin on Tuesday declined to comment on reports of a summit between Russian President Vladimir Putin and North Korean leader Kim Jong Un. This is according to a release by the AFP news agency.
The Kremlin spokesman made the remarks after the United States on Monday (Washington time) said North Korean leader Kim Jong Un was planning a rare visit. He will travel to Russia this September to meet with Russian President Vladimir Putin and discuss the possibility of supplying weapons for Moscow to use in the war of aggression against Ukraine.
Dr. Neth Savoeun: More than 84% of the people are aware of democracy through the election, more than 82% voted for the Cambodian People's Party (Central): Acting Prime Minister Dr. Neth Savoeun said that more and more Cambodians can Understand more about democracy by going to the polls More than 84% of the time, more than 82% of the votes cast for the CPP to continue to lead the new government.
This statement was made by Dr. Neth Savoeun on the morning of September 5, 2023, on the occasion of his visit to represent the Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Manet and Lok Chumteav Dr. Pech Chanmony to mark the 33rd anniversary. Complete the historic mission of the 246th Battalion, Phnom Penh Veterans and the 14th anniversary of the establishment of the Bodyguard Command.
