Dr. Neth Savoeun said: "Analysts and assessors want what is up to him, but it is not easy for any country to vote and all people are happy We note that this success "Prove that the understanding of democracy in Cambodia seems to be progressing. His people are aware of the case of obligations, the enemy wants to destroy, but also failed."
