Dr. Neth Savoeun stated that although some individuals analyzed the attack on the situation in Cambodia differently from the reality, but the love of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, love the Cambodian People's Party is clearly reflected by going to the polls. Strongly support the Cambodian People's Party to lead the Royal Government of the 7th mandate of the National Assembly.
