(Phnom Penh): Speaking at the 43rd ASEAN Plenary Meeting, Cambodian Prime Minister Hun Manet thanked Indonesia for its warm welcome to the Cambodian delegation and congratulated Indonesia on its well-organized The 43rd ASEAN Summit and related summits.
The opening ceremony of the 43rd ASEAN Summit (Plenary Session) was solemnly attended by the Sultan, the Head of State, the Head of Government and the wives of the leaders of ASEAN countries, the ASEAN Secretary-General, as well as international guests. Many more.
The high-level delegation of the Royal Government of Cambodia was led by His Excellency Hun Manet, Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia and Lok Chumteav Dr. Pech Chanmony Hun Manet, accompanied by the Deputy Prime Minister, Ministers of the three pillars and other senior officials.
