Many leaders also recalled the great reputation of Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen, former Prime Minister of Cambodia, who made a significant contribution to the formation and integration of ASEAN.
The five documents approved by the Summit are:
1. ASEAN Leaders' Declaration on ASEAN as the Core of Growth ASEAN Leaders' Declaration on Strengthening Food Security and Nutrition in Response to Crisis ASEAN Leaders' Declaration on the Development of the Digital Economy Framework Agreement Agreement on the Green ASEAN Economic Framework 5. Draft of the ASEAN Vision 2045
Commentary: Technology plus service is the main driving force of high quality development
BEIJING, Sept. 2 (Xinhua) - The 2023 China International Trade in Services Fair opened in Beijing under the theme "Opening up, promoting the development of win-win cooperation in the future." " The trade in services seems to open the door to opportunities for digital technologies and real-world economic integration, as well as accelerate the digitalization of the global trade in services and accelerate the revolution.
Xi Jinping said that at present, the smart industry and the digital economy are booming, which has significantly changed the way we allocate global resources, the formula for industrial development and the way people live. China attaches great importance to the development of the digital economy, promotes the deep integration of digital technology and the real economy, and continuously promotes the building of a strong Internet and digital nation.
China is willing to work with countries around the world to embrace the new trends of the digital age, deepen international exchanges and cooperation in the digital sector, promote innovation and smart industry development, accelerate the building of a common destiny. Internet space and together strive to pioneer a better future.
