The press release stated that "The meeting discussed and approved the agenda with the following results:
* First, the meeting approved to hand over the draft law on the establishment of the Ministry of Inspection to the Legislative and Justice Committee of the National Assembly for review and report to the National Assembly Standing Committee.
* Second, the meeting approved the handover of the draft law on the establishment of the Secretariat of State for Border Affairs to the National Assembly Committee on Legislation and Justice in cooperation with the National Assembly Committee on Interior, National Defense and Public Functions and the Foreign Affairs, International Cooperation and Propaganda Committee. "Information and information of the National Assembly, study and report to the Standing Committee of the National Assembly."
