The meeting was held at the office of the Ministry of Interior with the participation of the Deputy Commissioner of the National Police, Chief of Staff, Deputy Chief of Staff, Chief of Central Department, Deputy Chief of Central Department, Chief of Specialized Department, Deputy Chief of Department and Chief of all specialized offices.
