Today, the Secretary-General of ASEAN has 12 programs
On the morning of Monday, September 4, 2023, at the ASEAN Secretariat in Jakarta, Republic of Indonesia, Dr. Kao Kim Hourn, Secretary-General of ASEAN, met with Mr. Sok Chenda Sophea, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation. When the relevant ministerial meetings begin.
During the meeting, the two sides discussed the work of ASEAN and exchanged views on ways to strengthen ASEAN community building efforts. The ASEAN Secretary-General underlined the full support of the ASEAN Secretariat to Cambodia as well as other ASEAN Member States towards achieving the ASEAN Community Vision 2025 and beyond 2025.
