In the afternoon of the same day, the Secretary-General of ASEAN attended the 34th Meeting of the ASEAN Coordinating Council (ACC). The ASEAN Secretary-General updated the work achieved under the ACC mechanism after the previous meeting in May this year. The meeting also discussed in detail the preparations for the 43rd ASEAN Summit.
He then witnessed the signing of instruments to the Treaty of Amity and Cooperation in Southeast Asia (TAC) of the Republic of Panama, the Republic of Serbia and Kuwait, bringing the total number of TAC participants to 54.
