The Prime Minister and the Secretary-General of ASEAN also had a frank discussion on the future of ASEAN and reminded of Cambodia's success in chairing ASEAN in 2022.
Mr. Kao Kim Hourn met with Professor Klaus Schwab, Founder and CEO of the World Economic Forum. The two sides exchanged views on a number of areas of cooperation, such as digital exchanges, an environmentally friendly and sustainable digital economy, and a partnership between ASEAN and the private sector.
