Minister of Tourism urges leaders and officials to pay more attention to strengthening tourism development partnership
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Sok Soken, Minister of Tourism, urged the leaders and civil servants of the Ministry of Tourism to pay more attention to strengthening and expanding the partnership to develop the tourism sector by increasing the partnership in the development of the sector. Tourism is vibrant and responds to the needs of the development of tourism in a timely manner.
The Minister instructed this during the meeting with the leaders of all civil servants and contracted officers of the General Department of Administration and Finance and the General Department of Tourism Development and International Cooperation, a total of 350 people on September 4, 2023. At the Ministry of Tourism.
In addition, the Minister encouraged officials at all levels to contribute to the development of Cambodia's tourism sector, especially to strengthen the capacity, skills and talents of officials to promote the effective use of modern methods and technologies in operations.
