Oknha Kim Savuth, President of Khmer Food, a rice exporter to the Philippines, told Fresh News on September 4, 2023 that the second export of 1,040 tonnes of rice to the Philippines Up in August 2023. Exported rice is a common type of rice.
However, he said he had no plans to export more because at present the price of rice in Cambodia, especially plain rice, has risen too high as buyers in the Philippines have refused to raise rice prices. Then he can not export because it is not profitable.
Lon Yeng, secretary-general of the Cambodian Rice Federation, praised the second round of rice exports to the Philippines for more than 1,000 tonnes after years of trying to capture the market. However, he worries that rising rice prices, especially those of the Philippines, need to be significantly higher, which could hurt exports.
According to the price of rice recorded by the Cambodian Rice Federation, the average price of rice at the beginning of September was about 1,300 riel per kilogram. The price of regular rice in the international market is about $ 650 per ton.
Please be informed that Cambodia has started to export large quantities of rice for the first time to the Philippines in the amount of 2,575 tons, including 75 tons of red jasmine rice and 2,500 tons of soft rice at the beginning of 2023 after the Philippines. Change the policy of importing rice, that is, from importing through the state to the private sector.
According to the report of the Cambodian Rice Federation, in the first seven months of 203, Cambodia exported 362,708 tons of rice, earning more than 253 million US dollars, while exporting 2.4 million tons of rice earned more than 663 million US dollars. . Mr. Keo Phong has been appointed as an assistant to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party.
