PM Hun Sen Meets ASEAN Secretary-General
(Jakarta, Indonesia): Immediately after arriving in Jakarta, Indonesia, on Monday afternoon, September 4, 2023, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, His Excellency Hun Manet, paid a courtesy call on ASEAN Secretary-General Kao Kim Hourn. .
