(Phnom Penh): Three youths who posted motorbikes on public roads disturbed and could endanger passengers were arrested by Chbar Ampov district police for educating and removing the front wheels and let the owners of the front wheels jump around the flagpole . The arrest took place on the evening of September 3, 2023 at the point of the concrete road in Boeung Sno village, Sangkat Niroth, Khan Chbar Ampov.
Colonel Mao Soeuth said that after the arrest, the two motorcycles were now removed from the front wheels for the motorcycle owners to jump around the flagpole and talk about their mistakes and shout loudly to other young people. "Do not be like me." The three youths were temporarily detained for education, guidance, contracting and parents to give their thumbprints to secure their children and motorcycles.
