An orphan girl was raped by an old man until she was 5 months pregnant in Sithor Kandal district
(Prey Veng): An orphaned girl was raped by an old man while the animal was suspected of taking the victim girl for an ultrasound, only to find out that she was 5 months pregnant and immediately complained to the authorities to arrest her.
Sithor Kandal District Police said that the suspect who raped the girl until she was 5 months pregnant was named Don Rom, 57 years old, resident of Prey Doeum Thnong 4 Village, Prey Doeum Thnong Commune, Sithor Kandal District, Prey Veng Province. He was arrested on the afternoon of September 2, 2023 at Prey Doeum Thnong 4 village, Prey Doeum Thnong commune, Sithor Kandal district, Prey Veng province.
The reason is that the victim is an orphan living with the above suspect.
The suspect is currently being held at the Sithor Kandal District Inspectorate for legal action.
