Minister of Labor presents support and definition of employment
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Heng Sour, Minister of Labor and Vocational Training, presented the support and definition of employment as defined by the United Nations, the World Bank, the International Monetary Fund or the Asian Development Bank and the International Labor Organization (ILO). ).
In particular, the definition of unemployed refers to those who are of working age who are unemployed and looking for work and can accept employment opportunities or can work if available. This definition is universally accepted internationally.
In fact, in 2023, the ILO estimates that Cambodia has an unemployment rate of only 0.3%. This definition is universally used to collect data and produce statistics related to the unemployed and the unemployed, and no country, including Cambodia, can change this definition.
