The remarks by the senior Chinese official were made during a courtesy call on His Excellency Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the afternoon of September 3, 2023 at the Peace Palace.
During the meeting, the Prime Minister warmly welcomed Liu Jianchao's visit, which reflected the close cooperation and relations between the two parties and states.
Mr. Liu Jianchao also mentioned the high level of attention paid to Cambodia by the Chinese leadership, especially by President Xi Jinping, and congratulated the CPP on its landslide victory in the general election. On July 23, 2023.
With gratitude, His Majesty confirmed that this good result shows two measurements: (1). The support of the Cambodian people to Samdech Techo Hun Sen and the policies of the Cambodian People's Party and (2). The support of the Cambodian people to the successors of Cambodia.
He also stressed that Cambodia's development in all areas is inseparable from the support of the Chinese government and people, especially the timely assistance in the management of Kovid-19. Cambodia's success.
Mr. Liu Jianchao expressed China's strong commitment to Cambodia in promoting the implementation of all forms of initiatives and cooperation to be fruitful and successful. In this regard, he stressed that the Chinese government continues to support the Royal Government of the 7th legislature of the National Assembly under the leadership of His Majesty the King.
He also praised the Royal Government of Cambodia for launching a comprehensive Pentagon strategy, the first of its kind, with a clear strategy and vision in less than a month from the inauguration of His Majesty the King.
Liu Jianchao expressed his deep gratitude for the continued implementation of friendly diplomacy with China. This is the strong will to build a community of common destiny between China and Cambodia in the new era of 2024-2028, where the two countries are loyal friends and brothers who have always shared their grief.
Liu Jianchao has high hopes for the development of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Bhumibol Adulyadej, a young politician, full of ability, long-term vision and respectable political conscience.
He expressed his admiration for Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the King's Personal Advisory Council, who is a true strategist, revolutionary, leader and military and is considered a worthy political teacher. To be respected by the Chinese leadership.
His Excellency expressed his appreciation for this meaningful speech and wished Mr. Liu Cheanchao a fruitful success in this visit and wished him a safe repatriation.
The Royal Government of Cambodia, led by Samdech Hun Sen, has strong national, regional and international support.
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of September 4, 2023, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, His Excellency Hun Manet, will lead a delegation from the Kingdom of Cambodia to attend the ASEAN Summit in Indonesia. This is the first time that Samdech Hun Sen, on behalf of the head of the Royal Government of the 7th legislature of the National Assembly, has led a delegation to visit abroad.
Based on the above, it can be concluded with certainty that the Royal Government of the 7th mandate, led by Samdech Hun Sen, departed on the basis of strong support from both the national and regional countries. This morning, His Excellency Hun Manet led a delegation to attend the 43rd ASEAN Summit and related summits in Indonesia.
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Monday, September 4, 2023, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, His Excellency Hun Manet, will lead a high-level delegation to attend the 43rd ASEAN Summit and related summits at the invitation of Mr. Joko Widodo, President of Indonesia, Chair of ASEAN
The summit will be held in Jakarta from September 4 to 7, 2023, according to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation. Accompany the Prime Minister, including the Deputy Prime Minister, Ministers and key officials of the Royal Government, as well as many private sector leaders.
According to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, the ASEAN Summit in Indonesia will be held under the theme "ASEAN Importance: Core of Growth". It is important to strengthen ASEAN influence by optimizing institutions in order to seek benefits for their people on the international stage.
In addition, the discussions will focus on building an ASEAN community with a long-term vision and people-centeredness as a key force for achieving ASEAN 2045.
During his visit to Jakarta, His Excellency Hun Manet will pay a courtesy call and discuss work with President Joko Widodo. The Prime Minister will also hold bilateral meetings with his ASEAN counterparts and other key world leaders.
Please note that the trip to Indonesia now is the first appearance in the international arena of His Majesty Hun Manet as the Prime Minister of Cambodia.
