Minister Chamnimol expresses Cambodia's commitment to close cooperation with ASEAN member countries in the post-2025 ASEAN Vision Process
(Jakarta): Ms. Cham Nimmol, Minister of Commerce and National Representative to the ASEAN Economic Community Council, expressed Cambodia's commitment to close cooperation with all ASEAN Member States in the process of developing the ASEAN Vision. After 2025, aim to ensure that ASEAN can complete this work on time as planned.
During the meeting, the Minister also attended the opening ceremony of the ASEAN Digital Framework Agreement, which will accelerate the digital revolution, especially enhancing ASEAN's competitiveness in the global context.
