The following is a message from National Assembly President Khuon Sodary: Former opposition groups show support for the new government, which is in the best interests of the people (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Former opposition leaders and members show Strong support for the new Royal Government led by Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, which sets the priority policy on serving and improving the lives of the people.
On Sunday, September 3, 2023, former leaders and members of the opposition party who have joined the political life with the Cambodian People's Party from all over the country gathered in Phnom Penh to discuss and review past activities. Both set out work directions for further implementation.
The meeting, which also included a solidarity meal, was chaired by Mr. You Serey Vuth, Mr. Phen Phalla and Mr. Kong Liva, assistants to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party.
Mr. You Sereyvuth and Mr. Phen Phalla encouraged all former leaders and members of the opposition to continue the mission to protect the CPP, build popularity for the CPP, mobilize the opposition to join the CPP. In particular, together protect the new government of the new legislature led by Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet.
Representing the former opposition, Mr. Ear Channa spoke at the ceremony, expressing great congratulations and congratulations to the Cambodian People's Party for its victory and overwhelming support in the event of the 7th National Assembly election. Towards leading the Royal Government.
Mr. Ear Channa also congratulated His Excellency Hun Manet and the members who received the support of the National Assembly to lead the new government.
Mr. Ear Channa also expressed his strong support for the new Royal Government led by His Majesty the King Hun Manet, which set out a policy with high priority on serving and improving the lives of the people. He expressed his firm belief that the Royal Government led by His Excellency Hun Manet will make Cambodia prosperous and people's lives better and live in peace.
Mr. Ear Channa added that he, along with all former opponents, would continue to support and protect the Royal Government without any destructive forces.
During the meeting, Mr. Ear Channa and all former opponents expressed their gratitude and deep gratitude for the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen to bring peace and prosperity to Cambodia. In particular, we have prepared strong successors to ensure peace and continuous development.
All former dissidents also congratulated Samdech Techo and Samdech CPP leaders on receiving the King's approval to appoint him as the Chairman of the Supreme Council, the Honorary Chairman of the Supreme Council, as well as the Supreme Council. Personal advice to the King.
