At the same time, as modern technology becomes more sophisticated, the use of drones for full-screen imaging is allowed, and the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications will be involved in evaluating the technology to avoid distortion of the original image.
Prizes will be awarded to the winners from 1st to 5th place in both budget and trophy in mid-October. Hundreds of photos will be displayed at the awards ceremony, which will then be disseminated both domestically and internationally.
