JAKARTA: Indonesia's defense chief declined to issue a joint statement with his US counterpart during a visit to Washington last week after the Pentagon released a joint statement that allegedly criticized Jakarta and Moscow. Beijing. This is according to the release by the Russian news agency RT on Friday, September 1, 2023.
The Pentagon on Aug. 24 claimed that the United States and Indonesia share a common view that China's claim to sovereignty in the South China Sea is inconsistent with international law and condemned Russia's war of aggression in Ukraine.
