Mr. HUN MANY: Respecting the work approach to balance work operations and ensure state sustainability
Mr. HUN Many: Respecting the work approach to balance work operations and ensure state sustainability
(Phnom Penh): Mr. HUN Many, Minister of Public Works, on social media, on September 1, 2023, noted some of the remarks made by HE Dr. Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia during a meeting with workers. 20,000 people in Takhmao city, Kandal province this morning.
The following is the full text of Mr. HUN Many:
"This morning, I listened intently and noticed many points from the remarks and recommendations of His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet in the meeting with workers from factories / enterprises. The point that should be highlighted from the powerful words of His Excellency the Honorary Governor on the appointment of officials is the word "virtue and approach".
In fact, the policy of the Royal Government of Cambodia is to implement a long-term strategy to benefit the people with equity and social justice in a competitive environment.
Therefore, regardless of the appointment of officials or the performance of work within the framework of the work, the leaders of the Cambodian People's Party always adhere to the virtues (of the appointment) or, in other words, respect the work approach to maintain the balance of work operations. And ensure the sustainability of the state, both socially, economically and politically.
As the staff of the Royal Government, we firmly believe in the leadership of His Excellency the Honorary Governor and are always committed to adhering to the vision and policy of unwavering reform for the sake of our nation and people. Especially for peace and happiness for the next generation. ”Minister Chhay Rithy Sen recommended seven points to officials of the Department of Rural Economic Development to participate in the implementation of the Ministry's political program.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chhay Rithi Sen, Minister of Rural Development, on the afternoon of September 1, 2023, met with the leaders in charge and civil servants of the Department of Rural Economic Development and recommended to the officials of this department in Participation in the implementation of the political program of the Ministry of Rural Development to achieve more achievements.
