The Minister provided recommendations and instructions to the leadership of civil servants under the following departments:
1. Let the professional officers continue to work hard to fulfill their duties and responsibilities more successfully for the Royal Government of the 7th legislature in order to achieve the vision of Cambodia 2030 as a high middle income country and 2050 as an income country High.2. Every civil servant must present himself as a servant of the people wholeheartedly.
3. Department leaders must pay attention to and encourage officers to apply the principles of collective leadership to maintain unity and efficiency.
4. The department should study and understand the challenges of providing credit to rural people.
5. In order to promote rural economic development, the Ministry must increase the training of skills, education, change the attitude and mindset of the people in rural areas.
