By improving the quality of aviation security services in line with international standards and meeting the requirements of the International Civil Aviation Organization (ICAO) and the International Air Transport Association (IATA) and contributing to the creation of opportunities, excellence, competition. Increase value-added and gain more trust from airline operators and other stakeholders.
