On August 30, 2023, Daun Keo Mayor Kang Anan held a coordination meeting with the investors in the construction of the cloth market. As a result, the investors promised to complete the construction of stalls and the remaining work. Completed by September 30, 2023. The ground floor is ready and traders will come to sell on September 3, 2023.
