Remarks by HE Prime Minister Hun Manet Continues to Meet Nearly 20,000 Workers in Takhmao City
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Friday, September 1, 2023, His Excellency Honorary Governor Dr. Hun Manet continued to meet with nearly 20,000 workers. More from factories in Takhmao City, Kandal Province.
The following are the main contents of His Excellency Honorary Governor Dr. Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia:
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the welfare of the people and the work of serving the people are still a priority for the new government.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet expressed his desire to have a fourth child.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that as long as the people continue to support the Cambodian People's Party, it will continue its work policy and improve the lives of the people.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the results of the 2023 election clearly show the hearts of the people to the CPP.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that Kovid 19 has hampered Cambodia's economic growth but has not stopped Cambodia's progress.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that people who strive to build a righteous life, strive to build capacity to maintain social security, that is patriotism.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that strengthening the nation by improving the lives of the people is the national spirit.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that equity and social justice is to place the benefits in the hands of the people without concentrating on the hands of any individual.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that there is a mechanism to find jobs for people to work abroad in any country. But hard work to create local jobs is important.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the creation of local jobs is something that the Royal Government must pay attention to and not concentrate on in one place.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the policy of the Royal Government will continue to increase the wages of workers and salaries of civil servants as much as possible.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that the politics of the Royal Government led by the Cambodian People's Party is based on science, not sentiment.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet instructed the Governor of Phnom Penh to prepare a truck to transport workers to their hometowns on the occasion of Pchum Ben.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the costs that fall into the hands of the people should not be considered more or less.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the life of the people is very important for the nation, no people are no nation.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet thanked the people of Kandal province for voting for the Cambodian People's Party on July 23, 2023.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that the new Royal Government was born from the trust of the people and is not asleep.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet instructed the Ministry of Labor to take care of the work of informal economists when he went to register for the National Social Security Fund.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the leadership of the Ministry has been changed, but the vision and goals of the leadership have not changed and remain stable.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that in all ministries, only the Minister is changed, but the Secretary of State, Undersecretary of State, Advisor, etc. have not changed.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the appointment of officials has always been associated with virtue.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that achieving the work goals requires a spirit of unity and solidarity. It was this spirit that allowed the previous leaders to unite the nation and end the war.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that the appointment of officials in ministries must be based on meritocracy and the balance between the old and the new.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that in the past, district governors had the same status as ministers, leading to difficulties in performing their duties.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the appointment of Assistant Advisers of the Prime Minister, Deputy Prime Minister, Senior Ministers and Ministries ... to civil servants, the Armed Forces, if they take on equal positions ... Take work within the framework to eliminate roles with equal status.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that for the leaders of the private sector who have the title of Duke and Duke and are appointed as advisors can not have the same status.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet revealed that in the near future, a Royal Decree will be issued to determine the appointment and division of roles of civil servants of the Armed Forces so that they do not duplicate.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet instructed the workers to go ahead, if the minimum wage for 2024 is not yet released.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet revealed that there will be a Royal Decree on the appointment of advisors without duplication within the original framework
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that no matter how strong, without a reconciliation mechanism, the work can not be achieved.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet proposes to stop the culture of attacking each other because of conflicting views and opinions.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that the policy of the Cambodian People's Party is to serve all people without any bias.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet advised the people to wait and see the results of the work that he led.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet advised members of the Royal Government, especially ministers in ministries, if they are busy, do not need to accompany His Excellency to various forums.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that reform is difficult but must have clear goals.
