(Phnom Penh): Colonel Bun Satya, Deputy Chief of Phnom Penh Municipal Police, received the criminal plan and told Fresh News on August 31, 2023 that the Phnom Penh Municipal Police Office has cooperated with Chbar Ampov District Police and Police. Chheu Teal police station in Kien Svay district, Kandal province, investigated and arrested two suspects in a motorcycle theft case.
