The two suspects are: First: Puth Theara, male, 17 years old, guard, false occupation. Second: Sun Sima, male, 36 years old, false occupation. The two suspects live in Prek Thmey Village, Sangkat Prek Thmey, Khan Chbar Ampov. The two suspects were also involved in a case of electric shock in Kien Svay district.
