The statue of "Preah Kanes" near Kep beach, which cost more than 60,000 USD, was officially inaugurated
The inauguration ceremony took place on August 31, 2023 near Kep beach in Kep village, Sangkat Kep, Kep city, Kep province.
On that occasion, Mr. Som Piseth reminded that Preah Kanes is the second son of Preah Iso and is the younger brother of Preah Skant. He is a deity who represents knowledge and avoids obstacles.
Traditionally, the Buddha is placed in front of the entrance of a house, building or temple for worship, for he is a deity who removes all obstacles and evils, and the statue of him is placed in this place for the purpose of praying for the well-being of the builders. Travel along this road, especially tourists visiting Kep.
The provincial governor said, "This statue was built with the full support of Duke Yusan. The contribution left by the private sector to do business in Kep is a joint development of the province. "Overall, there is more growth in infrastructure in other areas as well."
According to Duke Yousan, the owner of the "Beach House" guesthouse in Kep City, the statue of Preah Kanes cost more than 60,000 dollars to build. The statue is made of sandstone and is almost 2 meters high. Construction of a luxury garden complex as well.
He said that the construction of the statue here in order to join the Kep provincial administration in promoting the improvement of public beauty in Kep, especially Kep to be beautiful as a tourist province and also a legacy. For Kep province as well as you do business here. The duke pointed out that the statue of Preah Kanes Ang could at least last for at least 100 years.
