EDC is preparing to implement a project to build a 230 kV transmission line from Ratanakkiri substation to Suong substation and from Svay Antor substation to Lvea Em substation.
(Prey Veng): Electricite du Cambodge (EDC) is preparing to implement a project to build a 230 kV transmission line from Ratanakkiri substation to Suong substation passing through Ratanakkiri, Mondulkiri, Kratie, Tbong Khmum and another line from Svay Antor substation in Prey Veng province. Go to Lvea Em substation in Kandal province to supply the people in this area enough as needed.
