This tragic incident happened on the morning of August 29, 2023 at Kampong Khsach bridge in Prey Konlong village, Prey Konlong commune, Po Rieng district, Prey Veng province.
According to the police, the victim was 20-month-old Vat Paksak, his father was 26-year-old Sen Vat, and his mother was 24-year-old El Chuk.
The police chief of Po Rieng district told Fresh News that the parents of the baby girl were Cambodian Muslims and that their occupation was fishing, most of them still on the boat. The negligence of the parents of the child victim led to the child falling into the river, causing him to drown.
