On that occasion, the provincial governor urged civil servants of the municipal / district administration, commune chiefs, commune chiefs to encourage fishermen in their jurisdiction to register their fishing boats or boats at the one-stop shop for officials. The installation of GPS tracking devices aims to increase the ease of rescue in the event of an accident at sea.
