(Jakarta): Dr. Kao Kim Hourn, Secretary-General of ASEAN, on August 29, 2023, attended the 30th ASEAN Socio-Cultural Community Council Meeting.
The meeting discussed the strategic direction of the ASEAN Socio-Cultural Community to strengthen and ensure a resilient, environmentally friendly and sustainable ASEAN, and also discussed the ASEAN Socio-Cultural Community after 2025. The meeting also thanked Indonesia for its chairmanship of ASEAN in 2023 and its commitment to support Laos as chair of ASEAN in 2024.
