Officially launched "Credit Contract Standards and Credit Contract Standards" for implementation in all banking and financial institutions as part of customer protection
(Phnom Penh): The Association of Banks in Cambodia and the Cambodian Microfinance Association this morning, August 29, officially launched the loan contract standard and loan contract standard for banking and financial institutions to provide convenience to customers. Promote transparency and consumer protection in the banking and financial sector as a whole.
Credit Contract Standards and Terms The credit contract standard will only apply to new lenders or new customers and will be effective from November 1, 2023 onwards.
Dr. Chea Serey, Governor-General of the National Bank of Cambodia, stated that the loan agreement and the standard agreement of the loan agreement is another new achievement in contributing to the protection of customers as well as the financial environment in Cambodia and to participate in the implementation of the Royal Pentagon strategy. The government in the seventh mandate as well.
She added that the loan contract standard and the loan contract standard stipulate the establishment of fees and other fees of the institution, determine the conditions or financing refers to the customer's right to re-apply for a loan, prior notice. Payment, early payment, withdrawal of title, and display of claim number in the contract.
He added that this standard contract and agreement must be implemented jointly among all financial institutions, including commercial banks, specialized banks, deposit-taking microfinance institutions, non-deposit-taking microfinance institutions, rural credit institutions and leasing companies. Finance.
"The official launch of the loan agreement standard and the terms of the loan agreement will make it easier for short-term clients and have the same content for loans under $ 50,000," he said. "This will ensure customer protection, transparency and fair competition among all financial institutions, which will maintain the sustainability of the financial sector as a whole."
Credit Contract Standards and Terms Credit contract standards are minimum credit contract standards that are divided into four categories, including: Standard loan contract with collateral, 2. Standard loan contract, no collateral, 3. Movable finance lease agreements and 4. Group loan agreement standards.
