Murder! Angry wife who drank alcohol every day, beat her with a bamboo stick, causing her death in Svay Chrum district
(Svay Rieng): Because his wife was angry and drank every day, regardless of the children, the suspect husband pulled out a bamboo stick and beat his wife to death, and the police arrested him.
This incident happened at 4:30 on August 28, 2023 in Kork Kandol village, Krol Ko commune, Svay Chrum district.
According to the police, the suspect was Neth Sophorn, 42, a farmer living in Kork Kandol village, Krol Ko commune, Svay Chrum district. The victim was Nget Soben, 59, a farmer living in the commune.
According to the villagers, before the incident, the victim and her husband had a big argument, while the husband blamed her for drinking every day, and then suddenly saw a bamboo stick to beat his wife to death. Surprise the villagers and report to the authorities.
Currently, the suspect was detained by the authorities and sent to the provincial police commissioner to proceed with the procedure, while the victim's body was arranged by relatives for a traditional ceremony. Brigadier General Born Bin Brings General Sao Sokha's Funeral to Two Families of Gendarmerie Veterans
