On the occasion of the appointment of the Deputy Commissioner of the National Police and the assignment of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police this morning, August 29, 2023, General Sar Thet stated that all police officers must remember that the duties and responsibilities of They are all trusted by the leaders from the past to the present, so they have to do their job properly.
