Remarks by HE Dr. HUN Manet Meeting with Nearly 20,000 Workers in Prey Speu, Phnom Penh, the First Public Forum as Prime Minister
(Phnom Penh): Not long after the new Royal Government was formed, His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet, the popular Prime Minister of Cambodia, also launched a series of dynamic agendas. And high responsibility. His Excellency Dr. Head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, 45 years old, also immediately resigned from the public.
His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet, Governor of Prey Veng Province, visited nearly 20,000 workers in Prey Speu, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh, the first public forum as Prime Minister.
The following are the main points of His Excellency the Prime Minister who spoke for more than two hours:
* HE Dr. HUN Manet brought Samdech Techo's words of advice to the workers and highlighted the heroism and merit of Samdech Techo who strives to lead Cambodia to a peaceful and prosperous stage.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the achievements that Cambodia has today are due to the continuous efforts of more than 40 years ago.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the leaders of the Royal Government are committed to maintaining the achievements left by the old people and continue to strive to create new achievements in the future.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet considered the meeting with the workers in Prey Speu area at this time as a habit.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the respect and love of the workers is the power for his leadership to create achievements for the nation and the people.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the meeting with the workers now to thank and reaffirm their commitment to national leadership.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that a strong, united nation must take care of its people by creating jobs and creating jobs for its people. The CPP has been doing this for more than 40 years.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet thanked the workers as well as the people who voted for the Cambodian People's Party to continue to lead the country, create jobs and build the country.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that the turnout of the CPP to more than 82% is a testament to the people's support for the CPP's policies.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet would like to thank all the employers who have trusted the Royal Government of Cambodia and invested in Cambodia.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that harmony in factories requires three main elements: workers, employees, employers and the authorities led by the Royal Government.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that the love of the people, even for thousands of years, is not a problem, unlike drinking energy drinks.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the new Royal Government continues to stand by the goal of maintaining the old achievements by ensuring the maintenance of peace, development and territorial unity.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that the policy of the Cambodian People's Party before the election, after the election, is the same.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that the policy of leading the country cannot be put in place. Each policy takes time to implement and takes time to reap.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that the policy of the Cambodian People's Party is not based on imagination, there is a clear study from experts.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the policy must be balanced, but the benefits for the people must change.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that he supported all criticisms but did not support any comments made to attack.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that the policy of the Cambodian People's Party continues to prioritize people, water, roads, electricity, but in addition to technology to modernize the people.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that a good policy is a policy that benefits the people.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the Royal Government of Cambodia has a policy of thinking about the people from the time of their mother's pregnancy.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet reminded that when the Kovid 19 plague in Cambodia, the Royal Government led by Samdech Techo used one hand to protect the lives of the people and the other hand to ensure the work of the people.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that his presence as Prime Minister now comes from the support of the people.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet told the opposition that His Excellency respects their protests but must also respect the voice of the more than 6 million people who voted for the CPP.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet thanked all the leaders of friendly countries for sending congratulatory messages to His Excellency after becoming Prime Minister.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the congratulatory message of the President of the European Commission is representative of all European countries.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that His Excellency has no time to quarrel with the opposition, only time to consider the well-being of the people.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that his current job as Prime Minister is equivalent to the weight of 10 large planes pressing on His Excellency.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that he did not oppose the opposition in the United States, which planned to demonstrate against him, but must respect the rights of those who supported him.
His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that the plan of the opposition in the United States, which demanded that the UN not recognize him, was a failure.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that he did not oppose the opposition in the United States, which planned to demonstrate against him, but must respect the rights of those who went to support him.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that receiving the US delegation yesterday was a sign that the United States recognizes the new government.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet announces the establishment of a special information team to cover various media and a special task force to address the people.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet advised that the recruitment of agricultural officials to work at the local level must be based on the principles of transparency, fairness and effective implementation.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet revealed that he had talked with the Minister of Culture to increase the number of historical researchers and to write history books.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that the work of serving the people is tiring but a great reward for His Excellency.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the wages of workers for 2024, more or less, must increase.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet reminded Samdech Techo as a child not to be the son of the Prime Minister, but to be the grandson of the farmer and to be with the farmer.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that plans can not succeed without a monitoring mechanism.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that the criticism to build is that he accepted the attack, creating a useless story, he did not respond.
* His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet stated that His Excellency must focus on leading the nation, solving people's problems for the benefit of the people, there is no time to respond to his attackers.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that the CPP understands, respects and does not quarrel.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet stated that taking the hearts of the people is not based on the performance of the speech on the forum, but on the actual results. Therefore, all officials must pay attention to serving the people.
* HE Dr. HUN Manet finished his speech at 10:20 AM the same day, thank you for watching the live broadcast on Fresh News TV. The EU will continue to provide good and close cooperation with the Royal Government of Cambodia to contribute to improving the lives of the people
(Phnom Penh): Carmen Moreno, EU Ambassador to Cambodia, who is completing her diplomatic mission in Cambodia, affirmed that the EU will continue to provide good and close cooperation with the Royal Government of Cambodia to continue to support Agenda and priority programs of the Royal Government to continue to contribute to improving the living standards of people from all walks of life.
This statement was made on the occasion of paying a courtesy call and saying goodbye to Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Economy and Finance on August 28, 2023.
Ms. Cameron Moreno praised the efforts of the Royal Government of Cambodia to ensure political and socio-economic stability and development of the country in all fields.
Taking this opportunity, the Ambassador also joined in congratulating the Cambodian people on the new government that emerged from free, fair and just elections.
She also expressed great satisfaction with the launch of a clear political program, namely the Pentagon Strategy, the first phase of the Royal Government, the 7th legislature of the National Assembly, under the high leadership of His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet, Prime Minister of God. Kingdom of Cambodia.
The Deputy Prime Minister expressed his deep gratitude to the European Union for its strong will and commitment to continue to contribute to the development of Cambodia, emphasizing that the EU is a major and important trading partner of Cambodia and We are confident that this relationship and cooperation will be stronger and deeper after the new EU Ambassador to Cambodia takes office in the near future.
The Deputy Prime Minister wished Cameron Moreno more success in fulfilling her new duties and role in the future.
