1. Perform professional work, respect discipline, respect laws, regulations and respect professional ethics. 2. Perform team work based on the spirit of common interests and values, coordinate, help each other and share. Adhere to a proactive, creative and problem-solving spirit, but do not create problems.
At the same time, the Permanent Deputy Prime Minister also reminded all leaders and civil servants of the Office of the Council of Ministers not to forget the five approaches of Samdech Techo Hun Sen in the performance of work: mirroring, bathing, scrubbing, treatment and surgery.
