The Deputy Prime Minister emphasized that the Royal Government of Cambodia, the seventh legislature, has launched the first phase of the Pentagon Strategy, which is the basic principle of the new Royal Government to continue to lead Cambodian ships forward more energetically and further. At the same time, the new Royal Government is committed to ensuring peace, political stability and peaceful living for all Cambodians. Pentagon Strategy has 5 mottos, 5 strategic goals and 5 key priorities
(Phnom Penh): The Royal Government of the 7th Legislature, led by His Excellency Honorary Governor Dr. Hun Manet, has decided to launch the "Pentagon Strategy" as its political program for building and defending the motherland 2023-2028.
The Pentagon Strategy - Phase 1 has two main historical missions: First, to maintain and maintain peace, which has been difficult to achieve with priceless sacrifice, and to mobilize the momentum of economic growth and development. Overall.
At the first Cabinet Meeting on August 24, 2023, HE HUN Manet highlighted that the "Pentagon Strategy - Phase 1" was designed for employment growth, equity, efficiency and sustainability to build the foundation for achieving the vision of Cambodia 2050. . The Pentagon strategy is a forward-looking strategy for 25 years that is considered, laid out and implemented in five stages.
With the five mottos and five strategic goals highlighted above, the Royal Government has decided to prioritize five key priorities for the Pentagon Strategy - this first phase includes: people, roads, water, electricity and technology that are primarily reflected. Through the strategic pentagon in the structure of the whole strategy.
