HE Hun Manet Instructs the Council of Ministers to Perform Effective and Highly Responsible (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): HE Honorary Governor Dr. HUN Manet, Prime Minister The Government shall implement the highest efficiency and responsibility in accordance with the working procedures and duties set out in the Royal Government Resolution of 22 August 2023.
The introduction was made at the first cabinet meeting this morning, Thursday, August 22, 2023.
The decision of the Royal Government dated August 22, 2023 has the following contents:
"Ministry of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection" to be renamed "Ministry of Inspection"
This decision was made at the first meeting of the Council of Ministers of the Royal Government of the 7th legislature, chaired by HE Dr. Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, this morning, August 24, 2023.
According to the results of the Council of Ministers, in 1999, the Royal Government established the Ministry of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection with the aim of promoting and strengthening governance to ensure the efficiency, integrity, professionalism, discipline, discipline and cleanliness of public administration. Contribute to preventing, combating, reducing and eliminating corruption.
The draft law on the establishment of the Ministry of Inspection has been prepared in 10 articles and has been approved by the full meeting of the Council of Ministers.
Please note that Mr. Huot Hak was appointed by the King to be the Minister of Inspection.
