Royal Government of the 7th Legislature Led by His Excellency Honorary Governor Dr. Hun Manet announced the implementation of the "Pentagon Strategy Phase 1" (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Royal Government of the 7th Legislature led by His Excellency Honorary Governor Dr. Hun Manet as Prime Minister On the morning of August 24, 2023, the first Council of Ministers officially announced the implementation of the first phase of the Pentagon Strategy.
The announcement of the implementation of this final strategy follows that in the last 25 years, the Royal Government of Cambodia has achieved complete peace, national unity and complete territorial unity through Samdech Techo Hun Sen's win-win policy, successfully implemented the triangular strategy and The four-phase rectangular strategy, with great achievements in all areas, both political, social and economic, which makes Cambodia change its face should be very proud.
The Pentagon-Phase 1 strategy is implemented in line with the "One-Person System" approach and continues to focus on the "Efficiency Achievement" agenda through the implementation of the "Mirror, Bath, Brush, Treatment" approach. And surgery. ”
China urges US to immediately cancel arms deal with Taiwan (Video inside) (Beijing) The United States plans to sell arms to Taiwan and urge the United States to change its decision immediately. This is according to the release by the Xinhua news agency on August 24, 2023.
Wang Wenping, a spokesman for the United States, said that US arms sales to Taiwan seriously violated the one-China principle and the provisions of the three agreements between China and the United States and the joint statement. In particular, the statement of August 17, 1982.
The Chinese government spokesman added that the sale also violates international law and fundamental standards governing international relations, undermining China's sovereignty and security interests and endangering peace and stability in the Taiwan Straits.
He added that China will take firm and vigorous measures to protect China's national sovereignty and territorial integrity.
The U.S. government has approved the sale of $ 500 million worth of military equipment to Taiwan for the sale of Infrared reconnaissance and tracking systems, F-16 fighter jets and related equipment to assist Taiwan in upgrading its advanced fighter jets. This will strengthen the military's ability to defend itself.
Mr. Neth Pheakdra vows to expand the media to spread the truth of Cambodia to the national and international community
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Neth Pheaktra, Minister of Information, emphasized that the priority work to be done as the Minister of Information is to focus on modernizing institutions and modern administration to make the Ministry of Information a public relations institution of the Royal Government of Cambodia. And disseminate the reality of Cambodia to the national and international community.
The Minister of Information made this remark during a meeting and visit with the leaders of civil servants in the General Department under the Ministry of Information on the afternoon of August 24, 2023.
Mr. Neth Pheaktra emphasized: “The priority work that I will have to do as the Minister of Information is to focus on modernizing institutions and modern administration to make this Ministry of Information a public relations institution. The Royal Government of Cambodia, which is proactive, active, quality and effective, aims to disseminate the truth of our Cambodia to the national and international community.
Mr. Neth Pheaktra added that this is the first day that he appeared to all civil servants of the Ministry of Information to get to know the Minister of Information in the seventh mandate and to continue the work to make the sector The information is even better. His Excellency Honorary Governor Dr. Hun Manet issued a decision to appoint Ms. Kim Sethany as the Permanent Secretary of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports.
The following is the decision of the Head of the Royal Government: Minister Heng Sour continues to inspect the living and working conditions of workers in rented rooms in Sangkat Tuol Sangke 1, Khan Russey Keo
(Phnom Penh): On the second day of taking office as Minister on August 24, 2023, Mr. Heng Sour, Minister of Labor and Vocational Training, continued to visit workers in rented rooms in Sangkat Tuol Sangke 1, Khan Russey Keo to understand the living conditions, working conditions, as well as the requests and needs of more workers.
It should be informed that yesterday, Minister Heng Sour visited the workers throughout the day, receiving information, data and suggestions related to living conditions, workplace conditions, including food, hygiene, working environment of workers. Even more so. These activities show the care of the workers thoroughly and get the enthusiastic applause from the workers.
After concluding the first meeting of the Council of Ministers of the 7th legislature this morning, Minister Heng Sour continued to visit the workers at the factory in Sangkat Tuol Sangke 1, Khan Russey Keo, even though they did not know before Surprised by the friendly reception with the new Minister of Labor.
The scene is full of intimacy through salutations, greetings, face-to-face conversations, smiles, laughter, fun, selfies together.
At the same time, the young minister did not forget to ask about the living conditions in the rented room, workplace, work environment, as well as other needs of workers, especially the Minister also highlighted the quality of the benefits and benefits. Obtained through the use of this SSS card and so on. He also inquired about the use of water, electricity, meeting fees, catering, as well as other welfare benefits.
In front of the workers, Minister Heng Sour stated that he will continue to work with stakeholders to monitor this work on a regular basis in accordance with the high guidelines of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, which advised the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training to consider The well-being of the workers is like the apple of their eye.
The strong emphasis of Minister Heng Sour is that every time he visits the workers in this first mission, he reiterated that the civil servants of the Ministry of Labor, including the manager of each factory must visit the workers often. In order to grasp the living conditions, working conditions, as well as the requests and needs of more workers to serve the people, to compensate the people for the value that the people have given trust to the Royal Government.
