Prime Minister Hun Manet's educational background:
His Excellency Hun Manet is the eldest son of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen. His Excellency was born on October 20, 1977 in Koh Thmor village, Memot district, Kampong Cham province (now Tbong Khmum province) during the Khmer Rouge era. He is married to Lok Chumteav Pech Chanmony and has two daughters and a son.
1980-1990: Girls' primary and secondary education (currently Chaktomuk Primary and Secondary School)
