His Excellency Colonel Hun Manet, in the framework of the Chief of the Armed Forces of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, Ministry of National Defense, ID No. 033883, was promoted to the rank of Brigadier General (1 star) by Royal Decree No. NS / RKOT / 0109/069, dated 26 January 2009.
His Excellency Brigadier General Hun Manet has been appointed Deputy Commander of the Bodyguard Command and Deputy Chief of Joint Staff of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces in addition to his current position by Sub-Decree No. 964, dated 13 September 2010. .
His Excellency Brigadier General Hun Manet was appointed Deputy Commander of the Army Command in addition to his current position by Sub-Decree No. 1150 dated November 30, 2010.
His Excellency Lt. Gen. Hun Manet has been appointed Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces in addition to his current position by Royal Decree No. NS / RKOT / 0718/695, dated July 06, 2018.
His Excellency Lt. Gen. Hun Manet has been appointed Commander of the Army Command in addition to his current position by Royal Decree No. NS / RKOT / 0918/933, dated September 06, 2018.
