Cambodia, India vow to strengthen and promote cooperation in the field of information technology
(Phnom Penh): At the B2B meeting between Indian IT companies and their Cambodian counterparts, the two sides pledged to make efforts to increase trade in information technology and communication between India and Cambodia, especially to promote cooperation in the field. Information Technology.
He added that the ESC, which has a 15-member delegation with experts in various fields of technology, aims to create a synergy of growth together: meet, connect and grow. This trade meeting will support our efforts to strengthen these engagements with Cambodia and facilitate the building of long-term economic ties between the two countries.
Dr. Devyani Khobragade also said that India and Cambodia have a warm and close political relationship which can facilitate trade partnership and friendship. With the aim of promoting trade and investment, the two sides are working on bilateral investment treaties as well as negotiating preferential trade agreements.
The Ambassador added that India and Cambodia are working towards connecting payment systems that enable UPI payments in Cambodia. Emphasizing the importance of direct air connectivity for business coordination, the utmost efforts are underway for the establishment of direct air connectivity between India and Cambodia.
Mr. Sovisothy said that the Royal Government of Cambodia has set out the Cambodia Digital Economy and Social Policy Framework 2021-2035 and the Cambodian Digital Government Policy 2022-2035 for building a vibrant digital economy and society to promote adoption. And digital transformation, accelerate new economic growth, build digital government, and provide efficient and inclusive public services.
He added that one of the strategic goals of Cambodia's digital government policy is to promote public-private partnerships. He expressed deep appreciation for India's ability in the field of information technology and expressed hope that today's event will give companies from Cambodia and India an opportunity to connect, cooperate, find potential partners and Opportunities for cooperation and investment.
